的 RSA=0.615 是 OpenVLA-specific 的 frozen encoder 观察。 TracVLA 用 Phi-3-Vision 的不同 encoder，NORA 用 InternViT——你们没测这些 encoder 的 RSA。 单架构 encoder analysis 不能 claim architecture-independent。\\\" 在 framework reframe 下， 此实验降为 \\\"framework 在 OpenVLA 上的 case study\\\"，不再是 core contribution。 LLM degradation（0.615→0.488）本身仍有价值但被限定为 \\\"observed in Llama-2-7B backbone\\\"。\\n\"\n51\t  },\n52\t  {\n53\t    \"name\": \"DINO baseline RSA\",\n54\t    \"description\": \"Standalone vision model 参照基线\",\n55\t    \"results\": {\n56\t      \"dino_rsa\": 0.388,\n57\t      \"dino_action_R2\": 0.687,\n58\t      \"dino_subtask_auc\": 0.972\n59\t    },\n60\t    \"tables\": [],\n61\t    \"figures\": [],\n62\t    \"analysis\": \"DINO baseline 在 worst tier 被 reviewer 用来论证 exit collapse 的 trivial nature： 如果未训练模型 R²=0.687 而训练后 exit R² 下降到 0.55-0.60，这可能只是 supervised learning 的通用 representation bottleneck 而非 VLA-specific routing。\\n\\n\\n数据不变。Worst 档下 DINO 的角色不变——纯视觉 baseline。但 reviewer 可能用 DINO 的高 action R²=0.687 攻击论文：\\\"DINO（self-supervised, 无 language, 无 action training） 的 action probe R² 已 0.687，你们声称的 VLA training-induced R² exit collapse 只是从 0.68 掉到 0.60——这可能只是 fine-tuning 过程中正常的 representation compression， 任何 supervised fine-tuning 都会导致 exit layer 表征质量下降。\\\"\\n\"\n63\t  },\n64\t  {\n65\t    \"name\": \"Per-layer RSA degradation curve\",\n66\t    \"description\": \"追踪 RSA 从 projector output 到 LLM 各层的变换轨迹\",\n67\t    \"results\": {\n68\t      \"proj_rsa\": 0.615,\n69\t      \"trained_peak_rsa\": 0.488,\n70\t      \"trained_peak_layer\": 9,\n71\t      \"untrained_peak_rsa\": 0.485,\n72\t      \"untrained_peak_layer\": 12,\n73\t      \"proj_to_l1_drop\": 0.13,\n74\t      \"inverted_u_pattern\": true\n75\t    },\n76\t    \"tables\": [\n77\t      {\n78\t        \"title\": \"RSA Inverted-U Architecture Coverage\",\n79\t        \"columns\": [\n80\t          \"Architecture\",\n81\t          \"RSA Per-Layer Done?\",\n82\t          \"Pattern\",\n83\t          \"Worst Interpretation\"\n84\t        ],\n85\t        \"rows\": [\n86\t          [\n87\t            \"OpenVLA (Llama-2-7B)\",\n88\t            \"Yes\",\n89\t            \"Inverted-U\",\n90\t            \"Only confirmed case\"\n91\t          ],\n92\t          [\n93\t            \"TracVLA (Phi-3-mini)\",\n94\t            \"No\",\n95\t            \"Unknown\",\n96\t            \"Cannot claim generalization\"\n97\t          ],\n98\t          [\n99\t            \"NORA (Qwen2.5-VL-3B)\",\n100\t            \"No\",\n101\t            \"Unknown\",\n102\t            \"Cannot claim generalization\"\n103\t          ]\n104\t        ]\n105\t      }\n106\t    ],\n107\t    \"figures\": [],\n108\t    \"analysis\": \"Framework reframe 下，inverted-U 成为 \\\"framework 在 OpenVLA 上发现的 pattern\\\" 而非 \\\"architecture-independent finding\\\"。可以保留为 case study 但不能 claim generality。 补救路径：增加 TracVLA/NORA 的 per-layer RSA 分析作为 framework demonstration。\\n\\n\\n数据不变。Worst D095 下，inverted-U pattern 只在 OpenVLA (Llama-2) 上验证。 TracVLA 和 NORA 的 RSA per-layer curve 未做（只做了 R² probe），所以 \\\"inverted-U is architecture-independent\\\" 无法 claim。Reviewer：\\\"RSA inverted-U 可能是 Llama-2 的 32 层架构特有的——Phi-3-mini 同为 32 层但 tokenization 不同，Qwen2.5-VL 是 36 层 且 GQA 架构，per-layer dynamics 可能完全不同。\\\" 此外 CKA 反转（plan_009）使 RSA 本身作为 metric 的 authority 被削弱。\\n\"\n109\t  },\n110\t  {\n111\t    \"name\": \"Output head analysis\",\n112\t    \"description\": \"SigLIP+projector frozen 确认, LLM 权重变化不传导到表征\",\n113\t    \"results\": {\n114\t      \"vision_projector_cos_sim\": 1.0,\n115\t      \"llm_rel_change_range\": [\n116\t        1.22,\n117\t        1.37\n118\t      ],\n119\t      \"head_vs_llm_ratio\": 1.12,\n120\t      \"shallow_adaptation_gate\": \"FAIL\"\n121\t    },\n122\t    \"tables\": [],\n123\t    \"figures\": [],\n124\t    \"analysis\": \"Worst tier 下此实验贡献接近零——reviewer 视为 trivial。但在 framework reframe 下 可以包装为 \\\"framework 的 component attribution 能力 demonstration\\\"：展示 framework 如何分离 encoder/projector/LLM 各组件的贡献。贡献在方法论而非 finding。\\n\\n\\n数据不变。Worst D095 下，此实验对 framework 贡献有价值——它证明 framework 能 区分 frozen 和 trainable 组件。但 reviewer 可能指出：\\\"这是 trivial verification—— OpenVLA 的训练代码明确 freeze 了 vision encoder，你们只是验证了代码做了它说的事。 这不是 experimental finding，是 implementation confirmation。\\\" 在 framework paper 中， 这降为 Section 3 的 methodology validation paragraph，不占独立篇幅。\\n\"\n125\t  },\n126\t  {\n127\t    \"name\": \"6 probing methods × 2 benchmarks 系统验证\",\n128\t    \"description\": \"系统性验证 trained ≈ untrained 表征结构\",\n129\t    \"results\": {\n130\t      \"trained_vs_untrained_delta\": 0.003,\n131\t      \"all_methods_consistent\": true,\n132\t      \"cross_benchmark_replicated\": true\n133\t    },\n134\t    \"tables\": [\n135\t      {\n136\t        \"title\": \"6 Methods Consistency (Worst-Tier Reinterpretation)\",\n137\t        \"columns\": [\n138\t          \"Method\",\n139\t          \"Trained-Untrained Delta\",\n140\t          \"Reviewer Interpretation\"\n141\t        ],\n142\t        \"rows\": [\n143\t          [\n144\t            \"RSA\",\n145\t            \"0.003\",\n146\t            \"Expected: frozen encoder dominates\"\n147\t          ],\n148\t          [\n149\t            \"R² probe\",\n150\t            \"0.015\",\n151\t            \"Expected: similar L0 inputs\"\n152\t          ],\n153\t          [\n154\t            \"CKA\",\n155\t            \"-0.006\",\n156\t            \"Reversal: undermines RSA conclusion\"\n157\t          ],\n158\t          [\n159\t            \"Action probe\",\n160\t            \"0.045\",\n161\t            \"Marginal: routing exists but small\"\n162\t          ],\n163\t          [\n164\t            \"Delta probe\",\n165\t            \"0.011\",\n166\t            \"Expected: similar input structure\"\n167\t          ],\n168\t          [\n169\t            \"Classification\",\n170\t            \"0.001\",\n171\t            \"Trivially easy for both\"\n172\t          ]\n173\t        ]\n174\t      }\n175\t    ],\n176\t    \"figures\": [],\n177\t    \"analysis\": \"Worst tier 下 6 methods consistency 从 \\\"strong evidence for Claim 3\\\" 降为 \\\"thorough but unsurprising verification\\\"。Framework reframe 下，价值在于 demonstrate framework 的 multi-method coverage 而非 finding novelty。\\n\\n\\nOrphaned 但子实验完成。Worst D095 下，trained ≈ untrained 的 RSA 结论仍成立 但意义被 D090 reinterpret：Reviewer 说 \\\"trained ≈ untrained 在 distributed representation (RSA/R²) 上不奇怪——frozen encoder 输出相同 L0 features，LLM 的 fine-tuning 主要影响 exit layer action head，中间层表征 naturally preserved。 这是 transfer learning 的常识，不需要 6 种方法来验证。\\\" 在 framework paper 中， 6 methods consistency 仍是 methodology 亮点——展示 framework 的 multi-method triangulation 能力。但 finding 本身被视为 expected。\\n\"\n178\t  },\n179\t  {\n180\t    \"name\": \"Instruction ablation\",\n181\t    \"description\": \"去掉 instruction text 测 RSA 变化\",\n182\t    \"results\": {\n183\t      \"delta_with_vs_no_inst\": 0.004,\n184\t      \"gate_judgment\": \"FAIL — instruction 无影响 on RSA\"\n185\t    },\n186\t    \"tables\": [],\n187\t    \"figures\": [],\n188\t    \"analysis\": \"Worst tier 下从 \\\"Claim 3 evidence\\\" 降为 \\\"expected sanity check\\\"。 但在 framework paper 中，instruction ablation 仍可作为 framework 的 \\\"controlled manipulation\\\" capability demonstration，只是不能 claim novelty。\\n\\n\\n数据不变。Worst D095 下，instruction 对 RSA 无影响是 OpenVLA-specific 观察。 Reviewer：\\\"RSA 测量 image token 的几何结构，当然不受 instruction 影响——image tokens 在 causal mask 下看不到 instruction tokens，这在你们 C1 里已经承认是 structural guarantee。所以 Δ=0.004 不是 finding，是 sanity check。\\\" 更严重的是，TracVLA 和 NORA 上未做此 ablation，所以即使从 framework demonstration 角度也只是单架构。\\n\"\n189\t  },\n190\t  {\n191\t    \"name\": \"2×2 matrix (training × instruction)\",\n192\t    \"description\": \"四条件全收敛验证\",\n193\t    \"results\": {\n194\t      \"four_cell_range\": [\n195\t        0.48,\n196\t        0.49\n197\t      ],\n198\t      \"bootstrap_ci_includes_0\": true,\n199\t      \"training_effect\": 0.003,\n200\t      \"instruction_effect\": 0.004\n201\t    },\n202\t    \"tables\": [\n203\t      {\n204\t        \"title\": \"2×2 Matrix (Worst-Tier: Expected Null)\",\n205\t        \"columns\": [\n206\t          \"Condition\",\n207\t          \"RSA\",\n208\t          \"Reviewer Verdict\"\n209\t        ],\n210\t        \"rows\": [\n211\t          [\n212\t            \"Trained + Inst\",\n213\t            \"0.488\",\n214\t            \"Expected: frozen encoder dominates\"\n215\t          ],\n216\t          [\n217\t            \"Trained - Inst\",\n218\t            \"0.489\",\n219\t            \"Expected: image RSA independent of text\"\n220\t          ],\n221\t          [\n222\t            \"Untrained + Inst\",\n223\t            \"0.485\",\n224\t            \"Expected: same encoder, same RSA\"\n225\t          ],\n226\t          [\n227\t            \"Untrained - Inst\",\n228\t            \"0.480\",\n229\t            \"Expected: null result confirmed\"\n230\t          ]\n231\t        ]\n232\t      }\n233\t    ],\n234\t    \"figures\": [],\n235\t    \"analysis\": \"Framework paper reframe 下，2×2 matrix 的价值从 \\\"empirical finding\\\" 转为 \\\"exemplar of framework's factorial design capability\\\"。论文可以说 \\\"our framework enables systematic 2×2 factorial decomposition of training and instruction effects\\\"——贡献在方法论可复用性而非结果。\\n\\n\\n数据不变。Worst D095 下 2×2 矩阵仍是 clean experimental design 但 被视为 \\\"confirms the obvious\\\"。Reviewer：\\\"frozen encoder + causal mask 已经预测了这个 null result。你的 2×2 design 很好但发现的是 expected outcome—— 这不是 contribution，是 verification。\\\" 在 framework paper 中，2×2 factorial design 可以作为 framework reusability 的 exemplar（\\\"researchers can apply this factorial approach to any VLA\\\"），但 the finding itself 不计分。\\n\"\n236\t  },\n237\t  {\n238\t    \"name\": \"Random instruction control\",\n239\t    \"description\": \"随机/无意义 instruction 替代验证 RSA 不受 instruction content 影响\",\n240\t    \"results\": {\n241\t      \"normal_rsa\": 0.489,\n242\t      \"random_rsa\": 0.484,\n243\t      \"shuffled_rsa\": 0.483,\n244\t      \"empty_rsa\": 0.472,\n245\t      \"max_absolute_delta\": 0.017,\n246\t      \"instruction_invariant\": true\n247\t    },\n248\t    \"tables\": [],\n249\t    \"figures\": [],\n250\t    \"analysis\": \"Framework reframe 下，random instruction control 与 006/007 合并为 \\\"three-way invariance verification\\\" 单段，作为 framework sanity check 的示范。占 0.5 段而非独立 subsection。\\n\\n\\n数据不变。与 plan_006/007 相同逻辑——causal mask 使 image token RSA 对 instruction 天然不变。四种 instruction 条件下 Δ<0.02 是 expected 而非 surprising。 Worst D095 的关键攻击面不在此实验本身，而在于论文用了三个 plan（006/007/008） 来验证一个 structurally guaranteed result，reviewer 会认为 \\\"过度验证 trivial prediction，浪费篇幅\\\"。在 8 页限制下这 3 个实验应压缩为 1 段。\\n\"\n251\t  },\n252\t  {\n253\t    \"name\": \"CKA verification\",\n254\t    \"description\": \"CKA 指标验证 RSA 发现的 metric robustness\",\n255\t    \"results\": {\n256\t      \"cka_ordering\": \"untrained > trained > projector > DINO (反转 RSA)\",\n257\t      \"rsa_cka_dissociation\": true,\n258\t      \"linear_cka_last_preaction\": 0.127\n259\t    },\n260\t    \"tables\": [\n261\t      {\n262\t        \"title\": \"Metric Ordering Reversal (Worst: Authority Crisis)\",\n263\t        \"columns\": [\n264\t          \"Metric\",\n265\t          \"Ordering\",\n266\t          \"Implication\"\n267\t        ],\n268\t        \"rows\": [\n269\t          [\n270\t            \"RSA (geometric)\",\n271\t            \"SigLIP > T > U > DINO\",\n272\t            \"Training degrades geometry\"\n273\t          ],\n274\t          [\n275\t            \"CKA (global)\",\n276\t            \"U > T > SigLIP > DINO\",\n277\t            \"Training preserves/improves structure\"\n278\t          ],\n279\t          [\n280\t            \"R² (functional)\",\n281\t            \"T_readout > DINO ≈ Proj > T_img\",\n282\t            \"Training enables routing\"\n283\t          ],\n284\t          [\n285\t            \"Reviewer question\",\n286\t            \"—\",\n287\t            \"Which metric is 'correct' for VLA evaluation?\"\n288\t          ]\n289\t        ]\n290\t      }\n291\t    ],\n292\t    \"figures\": [],\n293\t    \"analysis\": \"Worst tier 下 CKA dissociation 是双刃剑。Framework reframe 可以用它 作为 \\\"why we need multi-metric frameworks\\\"（方法论贡献），但这同时 undermine 了 R² exit collapse 作为 \\\"the architecture-independent signature\\\" 的 clean narrative。如果 exit collapse 只在 R² 下明显而 CKA 下不成立， reviewer 会要求 \\\"architecture-independent claim 必须 metric-independent\\\"。\\n\\n\\n数据不变。Worst D095 下 CKA-RSA dissociation 变得更致命。Reviewer： \\\"你们声称 R² exit collapse 是 architecture-independent training effect， 但 CKA（另一种 representational similarity metric）显示 untrained > trained—— 即训练反而增强了 global structure。如果换个 metric 就得到相反结论， 那 R² exit collapse 可能只是 metric artifact 而非 genuine information loss。 你们怎么证明 R² 比 CKA 更能捕捉 'action-relevant information'？\\\" 在 framework paper 中，metric dissociation 可以包装为 \\\"framework reveals metric-dependent conclusions\\\"——但这削弱了所有 quantitative findings 的 authority，因为 reviewer 会质疑每个 metric 的选择。\\n\"\n294\t  },\n295\t  {\n296\t    \"name\": \"LIBERO-Spatial cross-benchmark 扩展\",\n297\t    \"description\": \"第三个 benchmark（LIBERO-Spatial）交叉验证\",\n298\t    \"results\": {\n299\t      \"trained_image_mean_peak_R2\": 0.696,\n300\t      \"trained_last_preaction_peak_R2\": 0.675,\n301\t      \"untrained_image_mean_peak_R2\": 0.673,\n302\t      \"untrained_last_preaction_peak_R2\": 0.635,\n303\t      \"trained_exit_R2_delta\": 0.04,\n304\t      \"bootstrap_significance_p\": 0.001,\n305\t      \"cross_benchmark_consistency\": \"partial\"\n306\t    },\n307\t    \"tables\": [\n308\t      {\n309\t        \"title\": \"Cross-Benchmark Exit Collapse Comparison\",\n310\t        \"columns\": [\n311\t          \"Benchmark\",\n312\t          \"Trained Exit Delta\",\n313\t          \"Untrained Exit Delta\",\n314\t          \"Training Effect\",\n315\t          \"Interpretation\"\n316\t        ],\n317\t        \"rows\": [\n318\t          [\n319\t            \"LIBERO-Goal\",\n320\t            \"0.069\",\n321\t            \"0.015\",\n322\t            \"4.6x\",\n323\t            \"Moderate collapse\"\n324\t          ],\n325\t          [\n326\t            \"LIBERO-Spatial\",\n327\t            \"0.040\",\n328\t            \"0.023\",\n329\t            \"1.7x\",\n330\t            \"Weak collapse, task-dependent\"\n331\t          ],\n332\t          [\n333\t            \"LIBERO-Object\",\n334\t            \"0.121\",\n335\t            \"0.076\",\n336\t            \"1.6x\",\n337\t            \"Moderate but untrained also collapses\"\n338\t          ]\n339\t        ]\n340\t      }\n341\t    ],\n342\t    \"figures\": [],\n343\t    \"analysis\": \"Cross-benchmark 结果在 worst tier 下被解读为 exit collapse 是 task-complexity-dependent 而非 architectural invariant。如果 collapse 强度随任务变化，它更像是 training-specific adaptation 而非 fundamental routing reorganization。Framework reframe 可以 claim \\\"our framework reveals task-dependent routing intensity\\\"—— 但这削弱了 \\\"architecture-independent signature\\\" 的 universality。\\n\\n\\nLIBERO-Spatial 数据已部分完成（plan_010 status=preparing 但 registry 有结果）。 Worst D095 下，此实验是 OpenVLA 的 within-architecture cross-benchmark， 不是 cross-architecture validation。Reviewer：\\\"你从 LIBERO-Goal 换到 LIBERO-Spatial 只是换了 task suite 而非换了 VLA 架构——这不解决 RC4 的核心问题。\\\" 更关键的是，Spatial 的 exit R² delta 只有 0.04（vs Goal 的 0.069）， 说明 exit collapse strength 是 task-dependent 的。Worst 解读： exit collapse 不是 fundamental property 而是 task difficulty proxy—— harder tasks (Spatial) 产生较弱 collapse 因为模型需要保留更多 exit-layer information 来处理复杂空间推理。\\n\"\n344\t  },\n345\t  {\n346\t    \"name\": \"Full-layer R² scan\",\n347\t    \"description\": \"33 layers × 2 conditions × 2 aggregations = 132 probes 的 R² 全层扫描\",\n348\t    \"results\": {\n349\t      \"trained_image_mean_peak\": {\n350\t        \"layer\": 8,\n351\t        \"R2\": 0.655\n352\t      },\n353\t      \"trained_last_preaction_peak\": {\n354\t        \"layer\": 13,\n355\t        \"R2\": 0.678\n356\t      },\n357\t      \"untrained_image_mean_peak\": {\n358\t        \"layer\": 0,\n359\t        \"R2\": 0.64\n360\t      },\n361\t      \"untrained_last_preaction_peak\": {\n362\t        \"layer\": 32,\n363\t        \"R2\": 0.609\n364\t      },\n365\t      \"trained_exit_R2\": 0.422,\n366\t      \"untrained_exit_R2\": 0.545,\n367\t      \"exit_collapse_delta\": 0.123,\n368\t      \"best_vs_best_lastpre_delta\": 0.069,\n369\t      \"best_vs_best_lastpre_p\": 0.0001\n370\t    },\n371\t    \"tables\": [\n372\t      {\n373\t        \"title\": \"R² Exit Collapse: Missing Control (Worst-Tier)\",\n374\t        \"columns\": [\n375\t          \"Condition\",\n376\t          \"Peak R²\",\n377\t          \"Exit R²\",\n378\t          \"Delta\",\n379\t          \"Reviewer Critique\"\n380\t        ],\n381\t        \"rows\": [\n382\t          [\n383\t            \"Trained\",\n384\t            \"0.678 (L13)\",\n385\t            \"0.422 (L32)\",\n386\t            \"0.256\",\n387\t            \"Could be generic fine-tuning bottleneck\"\n388\t          ],\n389\t          [\n390\t            \"Untrained (random)\",\n391\t            \"0.609 (L32)\",\n392\t            \"n/a\",\n393\t            \"n/a\",\n394\t            \"Not a valid control for collapse\"\n395\t          ],\n396\t          [\n397\t            \"Llama-2 base\",\n398\t            \"0.645 (L9)\",\n399\t            \"0.555 (L32)\",\n400\t            \"0.090\",\n401\t            \"Base LLM also shows mild decline\"\n402\t          ],\n403\t          [\n404\t            \"NLP fine-tuned LLM\",\n405\t            \"???\",\n406\t            \"???\",\n407\t            \"???\",\n408\t            \"Missing: the critical control\"\n409\t          ]\n410\t        ]\n411\t      }\n412\t    ],\n413\t    \"figures\": [],\n414\t    \"analysis\": \"Worst tier 下 exit collapse 的 VLA-specificity 被根本性质疑。 缺少 NLP fine-tuned LLM 的 per-layer R² control 是最大 gap—— 如果 Llama-2 fine-tuned on any supervised task 也显示类似 exit collapse， 那 VLA training 的 \\\"unique\\\" contribution 归零。Framework reframe 下， collapse 降为 \\\"one of the patterns our framework detects\\\"， VLA-specificity claim 移除，改为 \\\"future work: compare across fine-tuning domains\\\"。\\n\\n\\n数据不变（OpenVLA 单架构）。这是 R² exit collapse 的源头证据。 Worst D095 下的核心攻击：Reviewer A 论证 \\\"exit collapse 是 decoder-only LLM 在 supervised fine-tuning 下的通用行为——last preaction token 在 exit layer 被 action head 'consume'，functional information 被转化为 action prediction 而非保留在 hidden state 中。这不是 VLA-specific routing， 而是任何 decoder-only model 做 seq2seq mapping 时的 normal information bottleneck。你需要对比 LLM 在 NLP task fine-tuning 下的 exit layer R² 来排除这个 confound——但你没做这个 control。\\\" Reviewer B 补充：\\\"untrained model（random init）的 last_preaction R² 在 L10-L13 pathological (≈0) 不是 exit collapse 的对照——random init model 在深层的 R²≈0 只是说明随机权重不能解码信息，这与 trained model 的 exit collapse 机制完全不同。你实际上没有一个 clean baseline。\\\"\\n\"\n415\t  },\n416\t  {\n417\t    \"name\": \"CLIP-ViT pretraining control\",\n418\t    \"description\": \"CLIP ViT-L 替代 SigLIP 区分 VL pretraining vs encoder quality\",\n419\t    \"results\": {\n420\t      \"clip_rsa\": 0.557,\n421\t      \"clip_R2\": 0.587,\n422\t      \"clip_lt_dino_in_both\": true,\n423\t      \"vl_pretraining_not_sufficient\": true\n424\t    },\n425\t    \"tables\": [\n426\t      {\n427\t        \"title\": \"Encoder Comparison: DINO Dominance Problem\",\n428\t        \"columns\": [\n429\t          \"Encoder\",\n430\t          \"RSA\",\n431\t          \"R²\",\n432\t          \"Has Language?\",\n433\t          \"Worst Implication\"\n434\t        ],\n435\t        \"rows\": [\n436\t          [\n437\t            \"DINO cls\",\n438\t            \"0.692\",\n439\t            \"0.634\",\n440\t            \"No\",\n441\t            \"Best in both metrics without language\"\n442\t          ],\n443\t          [\n444\t            \"SigLIP+Proj\",\n445\t            \"0.615\",\n446\t            \"0.630\",\n447\t            \"Yes\",\n448\t            \"VL pretraining inferior to DINO\"\n449\t          ],\n450\t          [\n451\t            \"CLIP ViT-L\",\n452\t            \"0.557\",\n453\t            \"0.587\",\n454\t            \"Yes\",\n455\t            \"VL pretraining worst of three\"\n456\t          ],\n457\t          [\n458\t            \"Implication\",\n459\t            \"—\",\n460\t            \"—\",\n461\t            \"—\",\n462\t            \"Language supervision hurts encoder quality?\"\n463\t          ]\n464\t        ]\n465\t      }\n466\t    ],\n467\t    \"figures\": [],\n468\t    \"analysis\": \"CLIP 结果在 worst tier 下不仅否定 VL pretraining 的 encoder quality claim， 更挑战论文研究 instruction routing 的 motivation：如果最好的 action representations 来自无 language 的 encoder，instruction routing research 的 practical relevance 是什么？Framework reframe 可以 acknowledge 这个 tension 并 argue \\\"understanding routing is important precisely because the relationship between language and action is non-obvious\\\"。\\n\\n\\n数据已完成：CLIP RSA=0.557 < DINO cls=0.692，R²=0.587 < DINO R²=0.634。 VL pretraining 不优于 self-supervised。Worst D095 下，此结果被 reviewer 进一步延伸：\\\"你们的 CLIP < DINO 结果说明 vision encoder 质量不取决于 language supervision，那你们为什么还在论文里花大量篇幅讨论 instruction routing？如果最好的 action representation 来自无 language 的 DINO， 那 VLA 的 instruction routing 可能是 overhead 而非 feature。\\\" 这挑战了整篇论文的前提——studying instruction routing in VLA 的意义。\\n\"\n469\t  },\n470\t  {\n471\t    \"name\": \"Branch-split RSA\",\n472\t    \"description\": \"DinoSigLIP fused backbone 中 DINOv2 vs SigLIP branch 分离\",\n473\t    \"results\": {\n474\t      \"dinov2_branch_rsa\": 0.619,\n475\t      \"siglip_branch_rsa\": 0.621,\n476\t      \"fused_rsa\": 0.634,\n477\t      \"post_projector_rsa\": 0.615\n478\t    },\n479\t    \"tables\": [],\n480\t    \"figures\": [],\n481\t    \"analysis\": \"Framework reframe 下可保留为 appendix 的 \\\"framework depth demo\\\"—— 展示 framework 能做 sub-encoder-level 分析。但不占 main text 篇幅。\\n\\n\\n数据不变。DINOv2 ≈ SigLIP（Δ<0.002）在 fused backbone 内。 Worst D095 下，此实验仅适用于 OpenVLA 的 DinoSigLIP backbone。 TracVLA 用 Phi-3-Vision 的不同 vision encoder（SigLIP-based 但 架构不同），NORA 用 InternViT。Branch-split analysis 不可迁移到 其他架构。Reviewer：\\\"这是一个 OpenVLA architecture-specific 的 interesting detail，但对 cross-architecture story 无贡献。\\\" 在 8 页限制下，worst tier 建议移到 appendix。\\n\"\n482\t  },\n483\t  {\n484\t    \"name\": \"Cross-Architecture R² Exit Collapse Matrix\",\n485\t    \"description\": \"3 架构 × 4 suite 的 R² exit collapse 矩阵——D095 升级的核心证据\",\n486\t    \"results\": {\n487\t      \"total_matrix_cells\": 10,\n488\t      \"cells_with_clear_collapse\": 6,\n489\t      \"cells_with_weak_or_absent_collapse\": 4,\n490\t      \"openvla_goal_trained_delta\": 0.069,\n491\t      \"openvla_spatial_trained_delta\": 0.04,\n492\t      \"openvla_object_trained_delta\": 0.121,\n493\t      \"openvla_long_trained_delta\": 0.004,\n494\t      \"tracvla_goal_trained_delta\": 0.09,\n495\t      \"tracvla_spatial_trained_delta\": 0.138,\n496\t      \"tracvla_object_trained_delta\": 0.294,\n497\t      \"tracvla_long_trained_delta\": 0.198,\n498\t      \"nora_goal_trained_delta\": 0.691,\n499\t      \"nora_spatial_trained_delta\": 0.302,\n500\t      \"mean_trained_exit_delta\": 0.096,\n501\t      \"cross_arch_r2_peak_layer_std\": 6.2,\n502\t      \"r2_collapse_confirmed_cells\": 6\n503\t    },\n504\t    \"tables\": [\n505\t      {\n506\t        \"title\": \"R² Exit Collapse Matrix (Worst-Tier Interpretation)\",\n507\t        \"columns\": [\n508\t          \"Architecture\",\n509\t          \"Suite\",\n510\t          \"Trained Delta\",\n511\t          \"Untrained Delta\",\n512\t          \"Ratio\",\n513\t          \"Verdict\"\n514\t        ],\n515\t        \"rows\": [\n516\t          [\n517\t            \"OpenVLA\",\n518\t            \"Goal\",\n519\t            \"0.069\",\n520\t            \"0.015\",\n521\t            \"4.6x\",\n522\t            \"Moderate\"\n523\t          ],\n524\t          [\n525\t            \"OpenVLA\",\n526\t            \"Spatial\",\n527\t            \"0.040\",\n528\t            \"0.023\",\n529\t            \"1.7x\",\n530\t            \"Weak — near noise\"\n531\t          ],\n532\t          [\n533\t            \"OpenVLA\",\n534\t            \"Object\",\n535\t            \"0.121\",\n536\t            \"0.076\",\n537\t            \"1.6x\",\n538\t            \"Moderate but untrained also high\"\n539\t          ],\n540\t          [\n541\t            \"OpenVLA\",\n542\t            \"Long (OFT)\",\n543\t            \"0.004\",\n544\t            \"0.016\",\n545\t            \"0.25x\",\n546\t            \"FAIL — no collapse\"\n547\t          ],\n548\t          [\n549\t            \"TracVLA\",\n550\t            \"Goal\",\n551\t            \"0.090\",\n552\t            \"0.048\",\n553\t            \"1.9x\",\n554\t            \"Weak\"\n555\t          ],\n556\t          [\n557\t            \"TracVLA\",\n558\t            \"Spatial\",\n559\t            \"0.138\",\n560\t            \"0.016\",\n561\t            \"8.6x\",\n562\t            \"Strong\"\n563\t          ],\n564\t          [\n565\t            \"TracVLA\",\n566\t            \"Object\",\n567\t            \"0.294\",\n568\t            \"0.009\",\n569\t            \"32.7x\",\n570\t            \"Strong\"\n571\t          ],\n572\t          [\n573\t            \"TracVLA\",\n574\t            \"Long\",\n575\t            \"0.198\",\n576\t            \"0.028\",\n577\t            \"7.1x\",\n578\t            \"Strong\"\n579\t          ],\n580\t          [\n581\t            \"NORA\",\n582\t            \"Goal\",\n583\t            \"0.691\",\n584\t            \"0.044\",\n585\t            \"15.7x\",\n586\t            \"Extreme — outlier?\"\n587\t          ],\n588\t          [\n589\t            \"NORA\",\n590\t            \"Spatial\",\n591\t            \"0.302\",\n592\t            \"0.037\",\n593\t            \"8.2x\",\n594\t            \"Strong\"\n595\t          ]\n596\t        ]\n597\t      },\n598\t      {\n599\t        \"title\": \"Matrix Coverage and Gaps\",\n600\t        \"columns\": [\n601\t          \"Metric\",\n602\t          \"Value\",\n603\t          \"Worst Interpretation\"\n604\t        ],\n605\t        \"rows\": [\n606\t          [\n607\t            \"Cells filled\",\n608\t            \"10/12\",\n609\t            \"NORA Object/Long missing — incomplete\"\n610\t          ],\n611\t          [\n612\t            \"Clear collapse (>0.10)\",\n613\t            \"6/10\",\n614\t            \"Only 60% cells show clear effect\"\n615\t          ],\n616\t          [\n617\t            \"Weak/absent\",\n618\t            \"4/10\",\n619\t            \"40% cells ambiguous or failed\"\n620\t          ],\n621\t          [\n622\t            \"Delta range\",\n623\t            \"0.004–0.691\",\n624\t            \"172x range — not 'consistent'\"\n625\t          ],\n626\t          [\n627\t            \"Peak layer std\",\n628\t            \"6.2\",\n629\t            \"High variability in where collapse occurs\"\n630\t          ]\n631\t        ]\n632\t      }\n633\t    ],\n634\t    \"figures\": [],\n635\t    \"analysis\": \"Worst tier 核心判定：cross-architecture R² exit collapse 是方向一致的（9/10 trained>untrained） 但 magnitude 高度不一致（0.004-0.691）。\\\"Architecture-independent signature\\\" claim 在 worst tier 下被降级为 \\\"a directionally consistent but magnitude-variable observation\\\"。 Reviewer 要求：(1) 解释 magnitude variation 的 mechanism（为什么 NORA 15x 于 OpenVLA？）， (2) 排除 training procedure confound（自训练 vs 社区 checkpoint）， (3) 提供 NLP fine-tuning baseline 排除 decoder-only generic effect。 Framework reframe：exit collapse 降为 \\\"one of the patterns detected by our framework\\\" 而非 \\\"the architecture-independent signature\\\"。强调 framework 能 systematically reveal cross-architecture variation 而非 uniformity。\\n\\n\\nWorst tier 假设：(1) OpenVLA Spatial（RUNNING）结果弱——exit delta 仅 0.04， 远低于其他 cells，且 untrained 也有 0.023 delta，training effect 仅 1.7x。 (2) OpenVLA Long (OFT) delta=0.004 已是 outlier。(3) NORA Object/Long 缺失（无 checkpoint），矩阵只有 10/12 cells。(4) 6/10 cells 有 clear collapse（delta>0.10 且 trained>>untrained），但 4 cells 弱或例外。\\nReviewer 攻击：\\\"你们声称 'architecture-independent' 但 10 个 cell 中 4 个 不支持。OpenVLA 的 2/4 suites 要么 delta≈0 (Long) 要么 delta 很小 (Spatial)。 只有 TracVLA 和 NORA 显示强 collapse——但这两个是你们自己训练的 checkpoint 而非社区标准模型。OpenVLA 是唯一的社区 checkpoint，它的结果最弱。 这可能说明 strong exit collapse 是你们训练流程的 artifact 而非 VLA training 的 inherent property。\\\"\\nReviewer B 补充：\\\"NORA goal delta=0.691 和 spatial delta=0.302 是极端值—— 比其他架构高一个数量级。这种 high variance across architectures（std=6.2 in peak layer）说明 exit collapse 的 magnitude 高度 architecture-dependent， 而你们只是 cherry-pick 了所有 delta>0 的 cell 来 claim 'consistent'。 Consistent direction（都 >0）但 inconsistent magnitude（0.004 到 0.691） ——这不叫 architecture-independent signature，这叫 noisy observation。\\\"\\n\"\n636\t  },\n637\t  {\n638\t    \"name\": \"Cross-Architecture L1 Attention (D090 Training-Induced vs Base-Model)\",\n639\t    \"description\": \"3 架构的 L1 instruction-dominant heads 对比——D090 区分 training vs base-model effects\",\n640\t    \"results\": {\n641\t      \"openvla_trained_l1_heads\": 24,\n642\t      \"openvla_untrained_l1_heads\": 0,\n643\t      \"openvla_oxe_l1_heads\": 25,\n644\t      \"tracvla_trained_l1_heads\": [\n645\t        27,\n646\t        30\n647\t      ],\n648\t      \"tracvla_untrained_l1_heads\": 32,\n649\t      \"nora_trained_l1_heads\": [\n650\t        12,\n651\t        13\n652\t      ],\n653\t      \"nora_untrained_l1_heads\": [\n654\t        13,\n655\t        14\n656\t      ],\n657\t      \"training_induced\": false,\n658\t      \"base_model_dependent\": true\n659\t    },\n660\t    \"tables\": [\n661\t      {\n662\t        \"title\": \"L1 Heads: Base-Model Dominance (D090)\",\n663\t        \"columns\": [\n664\t          \"Architecture\",\n665\t          \"Backbone\",\n666\t          \"Trained\",\n667\t          \"Untrained\",\n668\t          \"Training Effect\"\n669\t        ],\n670\t        \"rows\": [\n671\t          [\n672\t            \"OpenVLA\",\n673\t            \"Llama-2-7B\",\n674\t            \"24/32\",\n675\t            \"0/32 (random)\",\n676\t            \"Artifact: random init has no LM ability\"\n677\t          ],\n678\t          [\n679\t            \"OpenVLA\",\n680\t            \"OXE-pretrained\",\n681\t            \"24/32\",\n682\t            \"25/32 (OXE)\",\n683\t            \"Zero: OXE already saturated\"\n684\t          ],\n685\t          [\n686\t            \"TracVLA\",\n687\t            \"Phi-3-mini\",\n688\t            \"27-30/32\",\n689\t            \"32/32 (VLM)\",\n690\t            \"Negative: training reduces heads\"\n691\t          ],\n692\t          [\n693\t            \"NORA\",\n694\t            \"Qwen2.5-VL-3B\",\n695\t            \"12-13/16\",\n696\t            \"13-14/16\",\n697\t            \"Zero: same before and after\"\n698\t          ]\n699\t        ]\n700\t      },\n701\t      {\n702\t        \"title\": \"Remaining Training-Induced Effects After D090\",\n703\t        \"columns\": [\n704\t          \"Effect\",\n705\t          \"Evidence Strength\",\n706\t          \"VLA-Specificity\",\n707\t          \"Contribution Weight\"\n708\t        ],\n709\t        \"rows\": [\n710\t          [\n711\t            \"R² exit collapse\",\n712\t            \"6/10 cells\",\n713\t            \"Questionable (need NLP control)\",\n714\t            \"Thin\"\n715\t          ],\n716\t          [\n717\t            \"CF sensitivity\",\n718\t            \"11/12 settings\",\n719\t            \"Moderate (empty ≠ original)\",\n720\t            \"Thin\"\n721\t          ],\n722\t          [\n723\t            \"L1 head count\",\n724\t            \"REMOVED by D090\",\n725\t            \"Base-model artifact\",\n726\t            \"Zero\"\n727\t          ],\n728\t          [\n729\t            \"Total remaining\",\n730\t            \"—\",\n731\t            \"—\",\n732\t            \"Near-minimal for CoRL\"\n733\t          ]\n734\t        ]\n735\t      }\n736\t    ],\n737\t    \"figures\": [],\n738\t    \"analysis\": \"D090 在 worst tier 下是论文最大的 self-inflicted wound。Framework reframe 的关键 pivot：把 D090 从 \\\"limitation that weakens the paper\\\" 转为 \\\"framework's key analytical capability\\\"——\\\"our framework can distinguish training-induced from pre-existing properties, which is crucial for understanding what VLA training actually does.\\\" 这种 reframe 让 D090 变成 framework 的 selling point 而非 paper 的 weakness。但 reviewer 可能看穿这个 rhetorical move。\\n\\n\\nD090 发现 L1 head count 是 base-model-dependent 而非 training-induced。 Worst tier 解读：这是论文最严重的自我削弱。Reviewer：\\\"你们自己证明了 L1 routing——论文最 visually striking 的结果（0→9→24 heads gradient）—— 不是训练学到的。TracVLA untrained 已经 32/32 全极化，NORA untrained 已经 13/16。那 VLA training 到底贡献了什么？剩下的 training-induced effects 只有 R² exit collapse 和 CF sensitivity。但 exit collapse 可能是 generic fine-tuning effect（见上），CF sensitivity 可能只是 'model produces different outputs for different inputs' 的 trivial restatement。 你们把自己的 contribution 证伪到只剩一个 questionable finding。\\\"\\nD090 被解读为 \\\"VLA training 的独特效果只剩 exit collapse 一个，contribution 太薄\\\"。 即使 exit collapse confirmed in 6/10 cells，作为唯一 training-induced effect 支撑一篇 CoRL paper 太单薄。\\n\"\n739\t  },\n740\t  {\n741\t    \"name\": \"Cross-Architecture Counterfactual Sensitivity\",\n742\t    \"description\": \"3 架构的 counterfactual instruction sensitivity 对比\",\n743\t    \"results\": {\n744\t      \"openvla_object_d\": 1.21,\n745\t      \"tracvla_goal_d\": 1.52,\n746\t      \"tracvla_spatial_d\": 1.33,\n747\t      \"tracvla_object_d\": 1.21,\n748\t      \"tracvla_long_d\": 1.47,\n749\t      \"nora_goal_cos_saturated\": 1.0,\n750\t      \"cf_sensitivity_ratio_range\": [\n751\t        2,\n752\t        8\n753\t      ],\n754\t      \"empty_always_top\": \"11/12 settings\",\n755\t      \"openvla_long_anomaly\": \"shuffled > empty\"\n756\t    },\n757\t    \"tables\": [\n758\t      {\n759\t        \"title\": \"CF Sensitivity: Trained vs Untrained (Worst Interpretation)\",\n760\t        \"columns\": [\n761\t          \"Architecture\",\n762\t          \"Suite\",\n763\t          \"Trained d\",\n764\t          \"Untrained (cos)\",\n765\t          \"Ratio\",\n766\t          \"Reviewer Critique\"\n767\t        ],\n768\t        \"rows\": [\n769\t          [\n770\t            \"OpenVLA\",\n771\t            \"Object\",\n772\t            \"1.21\",\n773\t            \"0.569\",\n774\t            \"2.1x\",\n775\t            \"Moderate, within generic fine-tuning range\"\n776\t          ],\n777\t          [\n778\t            \"TracVLA\",\n779\t            \"Goal\",\n780\t            \"1.52\",\n781\t            \"0.153\",\n782\t            \"9.9x\",\n783\t            \"Strong but unfair: untrained=VLM base\"\n784\t          ],\n785\t          [\n786\t            \"TracVLA\",\n787\t            \"Spatial\",\n788\t            \"1.33\",\n789\t            \"0.180\",\n790\t            \"7.4x\",\n791\t            \"Same unfair comparison\"\n792\t          ],\n793\t          [\n794\t            \"TracVLA\",\n795\t            \"Object\",\n796\t            \"1.21\",\n797\t            \"0.185\",\n798\t            \"6.5x\",\n799\t            \"Same unfair comparison\"\n800\t          ],\n801\t          [\n802\t            \"TracVLA\",\n803\t            \"Long\",\n804\t            \"1.47\",\n805\t            \"0.173\",\n806\t            \"8.5x\",\n807\t            \"Same unfair comparison\"\n808\t          ],\n809\t          [\n810\t            \"NORA\",\n811\t            \"Goal\",\n812\t            \"saturated (1.0)\",\n813\t            \"0.081\",\n814\t            \"12.3x\",\n815\t            \"Numerical artifact? exit layer orthogonal\"\n816\t          ]\n817\t        ]\n818\t      }\n819\t    ],\n820\t    \"figures\": [],\n821\t    \"analysis\": \"CF sensitivity 在 worst tier 下保持 directionally valid 但 fair comparison 被质疑。关键缺失控制：NLP-finetuned LLM 的 CF sensitivity。 Framework reframe：CF analysis 降为 \\\"framework capability demonstration\\\"， future work 建议跨 domain（NLP/vision/robotics）对比 CF sensitivity。\\n\\n\\nCF sensitivity 是仅存的两个 training-induced effects 之一（D090 后）。 Worst tier 攻击：Reviewer：\\\"counterfactual sensitivity 只是说 'trained model produces different outputs for different instructions'——这是 ANY trained language model 的 basic capability，不是 VLA-specific routing。你们的 untrained model 是 random init（OpenVLA）或 base VLM without action head（TracVLA/NORA）， 当然 CF sensitivity 低——它们根本不是 functional models。这不是 fair comparison。 一个 fair comparison 是 Llama-2 fine-tuned on NLP 的 counterfactual sensitivity—— 如果它也显示类似 pattern，那 CF sensitivity 是 instruction following 的 generic property 而非 VLA routing。\\\"\\nNORA 的 cosine distance = 1.0（saturated）也有问题——这可能是 numerical artifact 而非 genuine effect（Qwen2.5-VL 的 exit layer 表征可能在不同 instruction 下 彻底 orthogonal 由于某种 architectural reason，而非 VLA training effect）。\\n\"\n822\t  },\n823\t  {\n824\t    \"name\": \"Three-Tier Routing Gradient (D094)\",\n825\t    \"description\": \"VLM base → OXE-pretrained VLA → task-finetuned VLA 三层级路由梯度\",\n826\t    \"results\": {\n827\t      \"tier1_l1_heads\": [\n828\t        0,\n829\t        32\n830\t      ],\n831\t      \"tier1_cf_sensitivity\": \"<0.2\",\n832\t      \"tier1_exit_collapse\": false,\n833\t      \"tier2_l1_heads\": 25,\n834\t      \"tier2_cf_d\": 1.048,\n835\t      \"tier2_exit_collapse\": false,\n836\t      \"tier3_exit_collapse\": true,\n837\t      \"tier3_cf_d\": [\n838\t        1.2,\n839\t        1.5\n840\t      ],\n841\t      \"gradient_narrative\": \"routing emerges at VLM→VLA, reshapes at general→specific\"\n842\t    },\n843\t    \"tables\": [\n844\t      {\n845\t        \"title\": \"Three-Tier Gradient: Data Sparsity (Worst-Tier)\",\n846\t        \"columns\": [\n847\t          \"Tier\",\n848\t          \"Description\",\n849\t          \"N data points\",\n850\t          \"Evidence\",\n851\t          \"Reviewer Critique\"\n852\t        ],\n853\t        \"rows\": [\n854\t          [\n855\t            \"Tier 1: VLM base\",\n856\t            \"No action training\",\n857\t            \"3 (Phi-3, Qwen2.5, random)\",\n858\t            \"No collapse, low CF\",\n859\t            \"Adequate N\"\n860\t          ],\n861\t          [\n862\t            \"Tier 2: OXE-pretrained\",\n863\t            \"General action training\",\n864\t            \"1 (openvla-7b ONLY)\",\n865\t            \"No collapse, strong CF, strong L1\",\n866\t            \"N=1, cannot establish gradient\"\n867\t          ],\n868\t          [\n869\t            \"Tier 3: Task-finetuned\",\n870\t            \"Task-specific training\",\n871\t            \"~10 (3 arch × 4 suites)\",\n872\t            \"Collapse + task CF\",\n873\t            \"Adequate N\"\n874\t          ],\n875\t          [\n876\t            \"Verdict\",\n877\t            \"—\",\n878\t            \"—\",\n879\t            \"—\",\n880\t            \"Step function, not gradient\"\n881\t          ]\n882\t        ]\n883\t      }\n884\t    ],\n885\t    \"figures\": [],\n886\t    \"analysis\": \"Worst tier 下三层级梯度必须移除或降为 \\\"preliminary observation\\\"。 Framework reframe：不 claim gradient，改为 \\\"framework enables comparison across training stages\\\"——展示 framework 能分析不同训练阶段， 但不 claim 发现了 systematic gradient。Future work 建议收集更多 Tier-2 数据点（不同的 OXE-pretrained checkpoints、不同的 pretraining datasets）来测试 gradient hypothesis。\\n\\n\\n三层级梯度被驳为 post-hoc narrative。Worst tier 核心问题：Tier-2 只有一个 数据点（OpenVLA OXE-pretrained）。Reviewer：\\\"你们的 three-tier gradient 有 multiple Tier-1 数据点（TracVLA Phi-3-Vision, NORA Qwen2.5-VL）和 multiple Tier-3 数据点（3 arch × 4 suites），但 Tier-2 只有 ONE 数据点 （openvla-7b OXE pretrained）。Three-tier gradient 需要 at least 3 intermediate points 才能建立 gradient 而非 step function。你实际上只有 step function：VLM (no routing) → VLA (routing)。'Gradient' 这个词 暗示 continuous variation，但你只有 binary transition + 1 intermediate。\\\"\\n更致命的是 Tier-2 的 L1 heads（25/32）几乎与 Tier-3（24/32）相同—— D090 已经证明 L1 heads 是 base-model-dependent。所以 Tier-2→Tier-3 transition 的 routing 变化主要体现在 exit collapse（有/无）和 CF pattern（general/task-specific）——但这些效应量很小且可能是 generic fine-tuning effect。\\n三层级叙事的第三个问题：没有第四层（如 multi-task→single-task fine-tuning） 来验证 gradient 是 monotonic 的。如果 further specialization 反而 reduces routing（如 libero_finetuned 数据中 L31 exit engagement 18→0）， 那 gradient narrative 不成立——routing 不是 monotonically increasing with specialization。\\n\"\n887\t  },\n888\t  {\n889\t    \"name\": \"OpenVLA Goal Standardized Pipeline (RUNNING)\",\n890\t    \"description\": \"OpenVLA LIBERO-Goal 标准化全流程——统一方法和指标的 re-run\",\n891\t    \"results\": {\n892\t      \"r2_exit_collapse_delta\": 0.07,\n893\t      \"l1_instruction_dominant\": 24,\n894\t      \"cf_empty_d\": 0.98,\n895\t      \"cf_sensitivity_ratio\": 3.5,\n896\t      \"cross_instruction_accuracy\": 1.0,\n897\t      \"rsa_peak_layer\": 12\n898\t    },\n899\t    \"tables\": [\n900\t      {\n901\t        \"title\": \"Standardized vs Original: Consistency Check\",\n902\t        \"columns\": [\n903\t          \"Metric\",\n904\t          \"Original\",\n905\t          \"Standardized\",\n906\t          \"Delta\",\n907\t          \"Concern\"\n908\t        ],\n909\t        \"rows\": [\n910\t          [\n911\t            \"R² exit delta\",\n912\t            \"0.069\",\n913\t            \"0.070\",\n914\t            \"+0.001\",\n915\t            \"Consistent but trivial\"\n916\t          ],\n917\t          [\n918\t            \"L1 instr-dom heads\",\n919\t            \"24/32\",\n920\t            \"24/32\",\n921\t            \"0\",\n922\t            \"Identical\"\n923\t          ],\n924\t          [\n925\t            \"CF empty d\",\n926\t            \"0.968\",\n927\t            \"0.980\",\n928\t            \"+0.012\",\n929\t            \"Consistent\"\n930\t          ],\n931\t          [\n932\t            \"RSA peak\",\n933\t            \"L12\",\n934\t            \"L12\",\n935\t            \"0\",\n936\t            \"Identical\"\n937\t          ]\n938\t        ]\n939\t      }\n940\t    ],\n941\t    \"figures\": [],\n942\t    \"analysis\": \"Standardized pipeline 在 worst tier 下的隐含风险：承认之前的实验 不够 standardized，可能让 reviewer 质疑所有之前的数字。 但如果数字高度一致，也可以作为 robustness evidence。 Framework reframe：强调 standardized pipeline 是 framework 的 核心贡献之一——\\\"plug-and-play analysis toolkit\\\"。\\n\\n\\nRUNNING 实验。Worst tier 预测：结果与已有 OpenVLA Goal 数据基本一致 （exit delta≈0.07, L1 heads≈24），因为使用相同 checkpoint。 但 standardized pipeline 可能暴露之前分散实验的 inconsistency—— 例如不同实验使用了略微不同的 hyperparameters（probe architecture, learning rate, seed）导致数字不完全 match。Reviewer 会注意到 \\\"为什么你需要 re-run standardized pipeline？之前的数字不可靠吗？\\\" 这暗示之前的 ad-hoc 实验流程不够 rigorous。 在 worst tier 下，standardized re-run 得到 slightly different numbers (e.g., exit delta 0.07 vs 之前的 0.069) 会被解读为 \\\"results are hyperparameter-sensitive\\\"。\\n\"\n943\t  },\n944\t  {\n945\t    \"name\": \"OpenVLA Spatial Standardized Pipeline (RUNNING)\",\n946\t    \"description\": \"OpenVLA LIBERO-Spatial 标准化全流程\",\n947\t    \"results\": {\n948\t      \"r2_exit_collapse_delta\": 0.04,\n949\t      \"l1_instruction_dominant\": 24,\n950\t      \"cf_empty_d\": 0.94,\n951\t      \"cf_sensitivity_ratio\": 3.0,\n952\t      \"exit_collapse_weak\": true,\n953\t      \"matrix_cell_verdict\": \"weak — borderline\"\n954\t    },\n955\t    \"tables\": [\n956\t      {\n957\t        \"title\": \"OpenVLA Cross-Suite Exit Collapse (Worst-Tier)\",\n958\t        \"columns\": [\n959\t          \"Suite\",\n960\t          \"Trained Delta\",\n961\t          \"Verdict\",\n962\t          \"Paper Implication\"\n963\t        ],\n964\t        \"rows\": [\n965\t          [\n966\t            \"Goal\",\n967\t            \"0.070\",\n968\t            \"Moderate\",\n969\t            \"Supports claim with caveats\"\n970\t          ],\n971\t          [\n972\t            \"Spatial\",\n973\t            \"0.040\",\n974\t            \"Weak\",\n975\t            \"Borderline — weakens universality\"\n976\t          ],\n977\t          [\n978\t            \"Object\",\n979\t            \"0.121\",\n980\t            \"Moderate-Strong\",\n981\t            \"Best OpenVLA cell\"\n982\t          ],\n983\t          [\n984\t            \"Long (OFT)\",\n985\t            \"0.004\",\n986\t            \"Absent\",\n987\t            \"Outlier — OFT confound\"\n988\t          ],\n989\t          [\n990\t            \"Overall\",\n991\t            \"mean=0.059\",\n992\t            \"Weak-Moderate\",\n993\t            \"OpenVLA is the WEAKEST architecture\"\n994\t          ]\n995\t        ]\n996\t      }\n997\t    ],\n998\t    \"figures\": [],\n999\t    \"analysis\": \"OpenVLA Spatial 弱结果是 worst tier 最关键的预测。如果确认， 论文面临 \\\"社区 checkpoint 最弱\\\" 的尴尬叙事——reviewer 会问 \\\"如果你们用社区标准 checkpoint 复现你们的发现，效果最弱， 这是否说明 strong exit collapse 是你们自训练流程的 artifact？\\\" Framework reframe 可以 acknowledge OpenVLA 作为 \\\"weaker case\\\" 并 argue \\\"our framework's value is precisely in revealing such cross-architecture variation\\\"。\\n\\n\\nRUNNING 实验，worst tier 核心关注。预测 exit delta 仅 0.04—— 显著弱于 OpenVLA Object (0.121) 和其他架构。原因： (1) LIBERO-Spatial 的 action 空间以位置 reasoning 为主， exit layer 需要保留更多 spatial information 来输出精确 actions， 所以 collapse 较弱。(2) OpenVLA 在 Spatial task 上的 fine-tuning quality 可能较低（Spatial 是最难的 LIBERO suite）， 训练不充分导致 exit reorganization 不完全。(3) 如果 untrained 也有 delta≈0.023，则 training effect ratio 仅 1.7x—— 在统计上可能 borderline significant。\\n这个结果直接影响 matrix 的 story：OpenVLA 的 4 个 suite 中 2 个（Spatial 0.04, Long 0.004）weak/absent，只有 Object (0.121) 和 Goal (0.07) moderate。社区标准 checkpoint 的 2/4 suites 不支持 exit collapse = 严重的 generalizability concern。\\n\"\n1000\t  },\n1001\t  {\n1002\t    \"name\": \"D090 Training-Induced vs Base-Model Distinction Synthesis\",\n1003\t    \"description\": \"综合分析：VLA training 实际贡献了什么——D090 后的 contribution auditing\",\n1004\t    \"results\": {\n1005\t      \"training_induced_effects\": [\n1006\t        \"R² exit collapse (6/10 cells)\",\n1007\t        \"CF sensitivity (11/12 settings)\"\n1008\t      ],\n1009\t      \"base_model_effects\": [\n1010\t        \"L1 head count\",\n1011\t        \"deep-layer probe stability\"\n1012\t      ],\n1013\t      \"removed_from_contribution\": [\n1014\t        \"L1 routing gradient (0→9→24)\",\n1015\t        \"attention reorganization\"\n1016\t      ],\n1017\t      \"remaining_unique_contribution\": \"thin — 1-2 effects, both questionable VLA-specificity\",\n1018\t      \"reviewer_expected_reaction\": \"contribution too thin for CoRL\"\n1019\t    },\n1020\t    \"tables\": [\n1021\t      {\n1022\t        \"title\": \"Contribution Audit After D090 (Worst-Tier)\",\n1023\t        \"columns\": [\n1024\t          \"Claimed Contribution\",\n1025\t          \"Status Post-D090\",\n1026\t          \"VLA-Specific?\",\n1027\t          \"Reviewer Verdict\"\n1028\t        ],\n1029\t        \"rows\": [\n1030\t          [\n1031\t            \"L1 routing (0→9→24)\",\n1032\t            \"REMOVED — base-model artifact\",\n1033\t            \"No\",\n1034\t            \"Cannot claim\"\n1035\t          ],\n1036\t          [\n1037\t            \"R² exit collapse\",\n1038\t            \"Retained but 4/10 cells weak\",\n1039\t            \"Questionable\",\n1040\t            \"Need NLP control\"\n1041\t          ],\n1042\t          [\n1043\t            \"CF sensitivity\",\n1044\t            \"Retained, 11/12 settings\",\n1045\t            \"Questionable\",\n1046\t            \"Unfair baseline\"\n1047\t          ],\n1048\t          [\n1049\t            \"Three-tier gradient\",\n1050\t            \"N=1 at Tier-2\",\n1051\t            \"Thin\",\n1052\t            \"Post-hoc narrative\"\n1053\t          ],\n1054\t          [\n1055\t            \"Experimental framework\",\n1056\t            \"Intact\",\n1057\t            \"Yes\",\n1058\t            \"Main contribution in reframe\"\n1059\t          ],\n1060\t          [\n1061\t            \"Metric dissociation (RSA/CKA/R²)\",\n1062\t            \"Intact\",\n1063\t            \"Yes\",\n1064\t            \"Methodological\"\n1065\t          ]\n1066\t        ]\n1067\t      },\n1068\t      {\n1069\t        \"title\": \"Worst-Tier Reviewer Score Prediction\",\n1070\t        \"columns\": [\n1071\t          \"Reviewer\",\n1072\t          \"Score\",\n1073\t          \"Main Concern\",\n1074\t          \"Accept/Reject\"\n1075\t        ],\n1076\t        \"rows\": [\n1077\t          [\n1078\t            \"R1 (generalizability)\",\n1079\t            \"3\",\n1080\t            \"40% matrix cells weak; no NLP control; contribution too thin\",\n1081\t            \"Reject\"\n1082\t          ],\n1083\t          [\n1084\t            \"R2 (methodology)\",\n1085\t            \"5\",\n1086\t            \"Framework is solid and reusable; findings secondary but valid\",\n1087\t            \"Weak Accept\"\n1088\t          ],\n1089\t          [\n1090\t            \"R3 (practical value)\",\n1091\t            \"3\",\n1092\t            \"No behavioral validation; no design implications tested; CoRL wants practical\",\n1093\t            \"Reject\"\n1094\t          ],\n1095\t          [\n1096\t            \"Mean\",\n1097\t            \"3.67\",\n1098\t            \"2 reject, 1 weak accept\",\n1099\t            \"Likely Reject\"\n1100\t          ]\n1101\t        ]\n1102\t      }\n1103\t    ],\n1104\t    \"figures\": [],\n1105\t    \"analysis\": \"Worst tier 核心结论：D090 的 honest analysis 是 scientifically correct 但 strategically devastating。论文自己证明了 3 个原 claim pillars 中 1 个是 base-model artifact（L1 routing），另外 2 个（exit collapse, CF） 缺少 critical controls。剩余的 unique contribution 太薄支撑 CoRL paper。\\nReframe 路径（accept probability 0.10→0.20 的条件）： (1) C1 升级为主贡献——framework 本身（factorial design + 4 methods + 3 arch validation） 是可复用工具，CoRL 有 benchmark/framework paper 先例。 (2) R² collapse 和 CF sensitivity 降为 \\\"findings the framework reveals\\\"—— 不 claim VLA-specific，改为 \\\"training-induced effects observable through our framework\\\"。 (3) D090 repackage 为 \\\"framework's distinguishing capability\\\"—— 能区分 training-induced vs pre-existing 是 framework 的 unique selling point。 (4) 增加 2-3 个 additional analyses（per-layer information flow entropy, cross-task representation transfer analysis）增强 framework demonstration value。 (5) 三层级梯度移除或降为 1 段 future work。 (6) 明确 roadmap：\\\"framework enables future closed-loop behavioral studies\\\"。 (7) Title 从 \\\"Architecture-Independent Routing in VLAs\\\" 改为 \\\"A Systematic Framework for Analyzing Instruction Processing in VLAs\\\"。\\n即使全部执行，worst tier accept probability 仍只 0.05-0.20—— 因为 CoRL 倾向 \\\"systems + results\\\" 而非 \\\"analysis + framework\\\"。\\n\\nD090 移除了最 visually striking 的结果（L1 head gradient）后， 论文的 unique contribution audit 在 worst tier 下： (1) R² exit collapse — 6/10 cells 确认但 magnitude 高度可变， 可能是 generic fine-tuning effect（缺 NLP control）。 (2) CF sensitivity — 11/12 settings trained > untrained， 但 unfair baseline（untrained = random init 或 VLM without action head）。 (3) 三层级梯度 — N=1 at Tier-2，post-hoc narrative。\\n至少 2 个 reviewer 给 reject，原因集中在： - \\\"What does VLA training ACTUALLY do that's unique? After your own D090\\n  analysis, the answer is 'exit collapse' — which may not be VLA-specific.\\\"\\n- \\\"Practical value unclear: knowing about exit collapse doesn't help\\n  build better VLAs. No behavioral validation, no design implications tested.\\\"\\n- \\\"The paper's main strength is the experimental framework, not the findings.\\n  But CoRL reviews papers for findings, not frameworks.\\\"\\n\\nExpected reviewer avg score: 3.5 (range 3.0-4.5) Accept probability: 0.10 (range 0.05-0.20)\\n\"\n1106\t  }\n1107\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dd136706-d17e-4708-8512-f9dedcb150bc","uuid":"883ebe53-5be0-4b59-a8ba-a899eeea5ea9","timestamp":"2026-05-22T03:07:51.806Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260522T021705/worst/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"SigLIP+Projector RSA vs Full VLA vs DINO\",\n    \"description\": \"SigLIP+Projector RSA 对比 Full VLA 和 DINO，证明 action-relevant 结构源自 frozen vision encoder\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"siglip_projector_rsa\": 0.615,\n      \"trained_with_inst_rsa\": 0.488,\n      \"untrained_with_inst_rsa\": 0.485,\n      \"dino_rsa\": 0.388,\n      \"llm_degradation_delta\": 0.127\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"SigLIP RSA Scope Limitation (Worst-Tier)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Source\",\n          \"RSA\",\n          \"Architecture Coverage\",\n          \"Worst Interpretation\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"SigLIP+Proj\",\n            \"0.615\",\n            \"OpenVLA only\",\n            \"Cannot generalize to other VLA encoders\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"VLA trained\",\n            \"0.488\",\n            \"OpenVLA only\",\n            \"Llama-2 specific LLM degradation\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"VLA untrained\",\n            \"0.485\",\n            \"OpenVLA only\",\n            \"Random-init Llama-2 specific\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DINO\",\n            \"0.388\",\n            \"Standalone\",\n            \"Reference baseline, unaffected\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Framework reframe 下此实验从 C1 core evidence 降为 Section 4.1 case study。 价值在于 demonstrate framework 的 encoder-LLM decomposition 能力，而非 claim 本身。 Reviewer 不会因此给分但也不会因此扣分——neutral contribution in worst tier。\\n\\n\\n数据已完成不变。但在 worst D095 下，此实验仅覆盖 OpenVLA 一种架构。Reviewer 攻击： \\\"SigLIP+DinoSigLIP projector 的 RSA=0.615 是 OpenVLA-specific 的 frozen encoder 观察。 TracVLA 用 Phi-3-Vision 的不同 encoder，NORA 用 InternViT——你们没测这些 encoder 的 RSA。 单架构 encoder analysis 不能 claim architecture-independent。\\\" 在 framework reframe 下， 此实验降为 \\\"framework 在 OpenVLA 上的 case study\\\"，不再是 core contribution。 LLM degradation（0.615→0.488）本身仍有价值但被限定为 \\\"observed in Llama-2-7B backbone\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"DINO baseline RSA\",\n    \"description\": \"Standalone vision model 参照基线\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"dino_rsa\": 0.388,\n      \"dino_action_R2\": 0.687,\n      \"dino_subtask_auc\": 0.972\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"DINO baseline 在 worst tier 被 reviewer 用来论证 exit collapse 的 trivial nature： 如果未训练模型 R²=0.687 而训练后 exit R² 下降到 0.55-0.60，这可能只是 supervised learning 的通用 representation bottleneck 而非 VLA-specific routing。\\n\\n\\n数据不变。Worst 档下 DINO 的角色不变——纯视觉 baseline。但 reviewer 可能用 DINO 的高 action R²=0.687 攻击论文：\\\"DINO（self-supervised, 无 language, 无 action training） 的 action probe R² 已 0.687，你们声称的 VLA training-induced R² exit collapse 只是从 0.68 掉到 0.60——这可能只是 fine-tuning 过程中正常的 representation compression， 任何 supervised fine-tuning 都会导致 exit layer 表征质量下降。\\\"\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Per-layer RSA degradation curve\",\n    \"description\": \"追踪 RSA 从 projector output 到 LLM 各层的变换轨迹\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"proj_rsa\": 0.615,\n      \"trained_peak_rsa\": 0.488,\n      \"trained_peak_layer\": 9,\n      \"untrained_peak_rsa\": 0.485,\n      \"untrained_peak_layer\": 12,\n      \"proj_to_l1_drop\": 0.13,\n      \"inverted_u_pattern\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"RSA Inverted-U Architecture Coverage\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Architecture\",\n          \"RSA Per-Layer Done?\",\n          \"Pattern\",\n          \"Worst Interpretation\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"OpenVLA (Llama-2-7B)\",\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"Inverted-U\",\n            \"Only confirmed case\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TracVLA (Phi-3-mini)\",\n            \"No\",\n            \"Unknown\",\n            \"Cannot claim generalization\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"NORA (Qwen2.5-VL-3B)\",\n            \"No\",\n            \"Unknown\",\n            \"Cannot claim generalization\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Framework reframe 下，inverted-U 成为 \\\"framework 在 OpenVLA 上发现的 pattern\\\" 而非 \\\"architecture-independent finding\\\"。可以保留为 case study 但不能 claim generality。 补救路径：增加 TracVLA/NORA 的 per-layer RSA 分析作为 framework demonstration。\\n\\n\\n数据不变。Worst D095 下，inverted-U pattern 只在 OpenVLA (Llama-2) 上验证。 TracVLA 和 NORA 的 RSA per-layer curve 未做（只做了 R² probe），所以 \\\"inverted-U is architecture-independent\\\" 无法 claim。Reviewer：\\\"RSA inverted-U 可能是 Llama-2 的 32 层架构特有的——Phi-3-mini 同为 32 层但 tokenization 不同，Qwen2.5-VL 是 36 层 且 GQA 架构，per-layer dynamics 可能完全不同。\\\" 此外 CKA 反转（plan_009）使 RSA 本身作为 metric 的 authority 被削弱。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Output head analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"SigLIP+projector frozen 确认, LLM 权重变化不传导到表征\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"vision_projector_cos_sim\": 1.0,\n      \"llm_rel_change_range\": [\n        1.22,\n        1.37\n      ],\n      \"head_vs_llm_ratio\": 1.12,\n      \"shallow_adaptation_gate\": \"FAIL\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Worst tier 下此实验贡献接近零——reviewer 视为 trivial。但在 framework reframe 下 可以包装为 \\\"framework 的 component attribution 能力 demonstration\\\"：展示 framework 如何分离 encoder/projector/LLM 各组件的贡献。贡献在方法论而非 finding。\\n\\n\\n数据不变。Worst D095 下，此实验对 framework 贡献有价值——它证明 framework 能 区分 frozen 和 trainable 组件。但 reviewer 可能指出：\\\"这是 trivial verification—— OpenVLA 的训练代码明确 freeze 了 vision encoder，你们只是验证了代码做了它说的事。 这不是 experimental finding，是 implementation confirmation。\\\" 在 framework paper 中， 这降为 Section 3 的 methodology validation paragraph，不占独立篇幅。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"6 probing methods × 2 benchmarks 系统验证\",\n    \"description\": \"系统性验证 trained ≈ untrained 表征结构\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"trained_vs_untrained_delta\": 0.003,\n      \"all_methods_consistent\": true,\n      \"cross_benchmark_replicated\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"6 Methods Consistency (Worst-Tier Reinterpretation)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"Trained-Untrained Delta\",\n          \"Reviewer Interpretation\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"RSA\",\n            \"0.003\",\n            \"Expected: frozen encoder dominates\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"R² probe\",\n            \"0.015\",\n            \"Expected: similar L0 inputs\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CKA\",\n            \"-0.006\",\n            \"Reversal: undermines RSA conclusion\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Action probe\",\n            \"0.045\",\n            \"Marginal: routing exists but small\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Delta probe\",\n            \"0.011\",\n            \"Expected: similar input structure\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Classification\",\n            \"0.001\",\n            \"Trivially easy for both\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Worst tier 下 6 methods consistency 从 \\\"strong evidence for Claim 3\\\" 降为 \\\"thorough but unsurprising verification\\\"。Framework reframe 下，价值在于 demonstrate framework 的 multi-method coverage 而非 finding novelty。\\n\\n\\nOrphaned 但子实验完成。Worst D095 下，trained ≈ untrained 的 RSA 结论仍成立 但意义被 D090 reinterpret：Reviewer 说 \\\"trained ≈ untrained 在 distributed representation (RSA/R²) 上不奇怪——frozen encoder 输出相同 L0 features，LLM 的 fine-tuning 主要影响 exit layer action head，中间层表征 naturally preserved。 这是 transfer learning 的常识，不需要 6 种方法来验证。\\\" 在 framework paper 中， 6 methods consistency 仍是 methodology 亮点——展示 framework 的 multi-method triangulation 能力。但 finding 本身被视为 expected。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Instruction ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"去掉 instruction text 测 RSA 变化\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"delta_with_vs_no_inst\": 0.004,\n      \"gate_judgment\": \"FAIL — instruction 无影响 on RSA\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Worst tier 下从 \\\"Claim 3 evidence\\\" 降为 \\\"expected sanity check\\\"。 但在 framework paper 中，instruction ablation 仍可作为 framework 的 \\\"controlled manipulation\\\" capability demonstration，只是不能 claim novelty。\\n\\n\\n数据不变。Worst D095 下，instruction 对 RSA 无影响是 OpenVLA-specific 观察。 Reviewer：\\\"RSA 测量 image token 的几何结构，当然不受 instruction 影响——image tokens 在 causal mask 下看不到 instruction tokens，这在你们 C1 里已经承认是 structural guarantee。所以 Δ=0.004 不是 finding，是 sanity check。\\\" 更严重的是，TracVLA 和 NORA 上未做此 ablation，所以即使从 framework demonstration 角度也只是单架构。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"2×2 matrix (training × instruction)\",\n    \"description\": \"四条件全收敛验证\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"four_cell_range\": [\n        0.48,\n        0.49\n      ],\n      \"bootstrap_ci_includes_0\": true,\n      \"training_effect\": 0.003,\n      \"instruction_effect\": 0.004\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"2×2 Matrix (Worst-Tier: Expected Null)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"RSA\",\n          \"Reviewer Verdict\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Trained + Inst\",\n            \"0.488\",\n            \"Expected: frozen encoder dominates\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Trained - Inst\",\n            \"0.489\",\n            \"Expected: image RSA independent of text\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Untrained + Inst\",\n            \"0.485\",\n            \"Expected: same encoder, same RSA\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Untrained - Inst\",\n            \"0.480\",\n            \"Expected: null result confirmed\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Framework paper reframe 下，2×2 matrix 的价值从 \\\"empirical finding\\\" 转为 \\\"exemplar of framework's factorial design capability\\\"。论文可以说 \\\"our framework enables systematic 2×2 factorial decomposition of training and instruction effects\\\"——贡献在方法论可复用性而非结果。\\n\\n\\n数据不变。Worst D095 下 2×2 矩阵仍是 clean experimental design 但 被视为 \\\"confirms the obvious\\\"。Reviewer：\\\"frozen encoder + causal mask 已经预测了这个 null result。你的 2×2 design 很好但发现的是 expected outcome—— 这不是 contribution，是 verification。\\\" 在 framework paper 中，2×2 factorial design 可以作为 framework reusability 的 exemplar（\\\"researchers can apply this factorial approach to any VLA\\\"），但 the finding itself 不计分。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Random instruction control\",\n    \"description\": \"随机/无意义 instruction 替代验证 RSA 不受 instruction content 影响\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"normal_rsa\": 0.489,\n      \"random_rsa\": 0.484,\n      \"shuffled_rsa\": 0.483,\n      \"empty_rsa\": 0.472,\n      \"max_absolute_delta\": 0.017,\n      \"instruction_invariant\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Framework reframe 下，random instruction control 与 006/007 合并为 \\\"three-way invariance verification\\\" 单段，作为 framework sanity check 的示范。占 0.5 段而非独立 subsection。\\n\\n\\n数据不变。与 plan_006/007 相同逻辑——causal mask 使 image token RSA 对 instruction 天然不变。四种 instruction 条件下 Δ<0.02 是 expected 而非 surprising。 Worst D095 的关键攻击面不在此实验本身，而在于论文用了三个 plan（006/007/008） 来验证一个 structurally guaranteed result，reviewer 会认为 \\\"过度验证 trivial prediction，浪费篇幅\\\"。在 8 页限制下这 3 个实验应压缩为 1 段。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"CKA verification\",\n    \"description\": \"CKA 指标验证 RSA 发现的 metric robustness\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"cka_ordering\": \"untrained > trained > projector > DINO (反转 RSA)\",\n      \"rsa_cka_dissociation\": true,\n      \"linear_cka_last_preaction\": 0.127\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Metric Ordering Reversal (Worst: Authority Crisis)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"Ordering\",\n          \"Implication\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"RSA (geometric)\",\n            \"SigLIP > T > U > DINO\",\n            \"Training degrades geometry\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CKA (global)\",\n            \"U > T > SigLIP > DINO\",\n            \"Training preserves/improves structure\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"R² (functional)\",\n            \"T_readout > DINO ≈ Proj > T_img\",\n            \"Training enables routing\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Reviewer question\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"Which metric is 'correct' for VLA evaluation?\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Worst tier 下 CKA dissociation 是双刃剑。Framework reframe 可以用它 作为 \\\"why we need multi-metric frameworks\\\"（方法论贡献），但这同时 undermine 了 R² exit collapse 作为 \\\"the architecture-independent signature\\\" 的 clean narrative。如果 exit collapse 只在 R² 下明显而 CKA 下不成立， reviewer 会要求 \\\"architecture-independent claim 必须 metric-independent\\\"。\\n\\n\\n数据不变。Worst D095 下 CKA-RSA dissociation 变得更致命。Reviewer： \\\"你们声称 R² exit collapse 是 architecture-independent training effect， 但 CKA（另一种 representational similarity metric）显示 untrained > trained—— 即训练反而增强了 global structure。如果换个 metric 就得到相反结论， 那 R² exit collapse 可能只是 metric artifact 而非 genuine information loss。 你们怎么证明 R² 比 CKA 更能捕捉 'action-relevant information'？\\\" 在 framework paper 中，metric dissociation 可以包装为 \\\"framework reveals metric-dependent conclusions\\\"——但这削弱了所有 quantitative findings 的 authority，因为 reviewer 会质疑每个 metric 的选择。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LIBERO-Spatial cross-benchmark 扩展\",\n    \"description\": \"第三个 benchmark（LIBERO-Spatial）交叉验证\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"trained_image_mean_peak_R2\": 0.696,\n      \"trained_last_preaction_peak_R2\": 0.675,\n      \"untrained_image_mean_peak_R2\": 0.673,\n      \"untrained_last_preaction_peak_R2\": 0.635,\n      \"trained_exit_R2_delta\": 0.04,\n      \"bootstrap_significance_p\": 0.001,\n      \"cross_benchmark_consistency\": \"partial\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Cross-Benchmark Exit Collapse Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Benchmark\",\n          \"Trained Exit Delta\",\n          \"Untrained Exit Delta\",\n          \"Training Effect\",\n          \"Interpretation\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"LIBERO-Goal\",\n            \"0.069\",\n            \"0.015\",\n            \"4.6x\",\n            \"Moderate collapse\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LIBERO-Spatial\",\n            \"0.040\",\n            \"0.023\",\n            \"1.7x\",\n            \"Weak collapse, task-dependent\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LIBERO-Object\",\n            \"0.121\",\n            \"0.076\",\n            \"1.6x\",\n            \"Moderate but untrained also collapses\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Cross-benchmark 结果在 worst tier 下被解读为 exit collapse 是 task-complexity-dependent 而非 architectural invariant。如果 collapse 强度随任务变化，它更像是 training-specific adaptation 而非 fundamental routing reorganization。Framework reframe 可以 claim \\\"our framework reveals task-dependent routing intensity\\\"—— 但这削弱了 \\\"architecture-independent signature\\\" 的 universality。\\n\\n\\nLIBERO-Spatial 数据已部分完成（plan_010 status=preparing 但 registry 有结果）。 Worst D095 下，此实验是 OpenVLA 的 within-architecture cross-benchmark， 不是 cross-architecture validation。Reviewer：\\\"你从 LIBERO-Goal 换到 LIBERO-Spatial 只是换了 task suite 而非换了 VLA 架构——这不解决 RC4 的核心问题。\\\" 更关键的是，Spatial 的 exit R² delta 只有 0.04（vs Goal 的 0.069）， 说明 exit collapse strength 是 task-dependent 的。Worst 解读： exit collapse 不是 fundamental property 而是 task difficulty proxy—— harder tasks (Spatial) 产生较弱 collapse 因为模型需要保留更多 exit-layer information 来处理复杂空间推理。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Full-layer R² scan\",\n    \"description\": \"33 layers × 2 conditions × 2 aggregations = 132 probes 的 R² 全层扫描\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"trained_image_mean_peak\": {\n        \"layer\": 8,\n        \"R2\": 0.655\n      },\n      \"trained_last_preaction_peak\": {\n        \"layer\": 13,\n        \"R2\": 0.678\n      },\n      \"untrained_image_mean_peak\": {\n        \"layer\": 0,\n        \"R2\": 0.64\n      },\n      \"untrained_last_preaction_peak\": {\n        \"layer\": 32,\n        \"R2\": 0.609\n      },\n      \"trained_exit_R2\": 0.422,\n      \"untrained_exit_R2\": 0.545,\n      \"exit_collapse_delta\": 0.123,\n      \"best_vs_best_lastpre_delta\": 0.069,\n      \"best_vs_best_lastpre_p\": 0.0001\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"R² Exit Collapse: Missing Control (Worst-Tier)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"Peak R²\",\n          \"Exit R²\",\n          \"Delta\",\n          \"Reviewer Critique\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Trained\",\n            \"0.678 (L13)\",\n            \"0.422 (L32)\",\n            \"0.256\",\n            \"Could be generic fine-tuning bottleneck\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Untrained (random)\",\n            \"0.609 (L32)\",\n            \"n/a\",\n            \"n/a\",\n            \"Not a valid control for collapse\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-2 base\",\n            \"0.645 (L9)\",\n            \"0.555 (L32)\",\n            \"0.090\",\n            \"Base LLM also shows mild decline\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"NLP fine-tuned LLM\",\n            \"???\",\n            \"???\",\n            \"???\",\n            \"Missing: the critical control\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Worst tier 下 exit collapse 的 VLA-specificity 被根本性质疑。 缺少 NLP fine-tuned LLM 的 per-layer R² control 是最大 gap—— 如果 Llama-2 fine-tuned on any supervised task 也显示类似 exit collapse， 那 VLA training 的 \\\"unique\\\" contribution 归零。Framework reframe 下， collapse 降为 \\\"one of the patterns our framework detects\\\"， VLA-specificity claim 移除，改为 \\\"future work: compare across fine-tuning domains\\\"。\\n\\n\\n数据不变（OpenVLA 单架构）。这是 R² exit collapse 的源头证据。 Worst D095 下的核心攻击：Reviewer A 论证 \\\"exit collapse 是 decoder-only LLM 在 supervised fine-tuning 下的通用行为——last preaction token 在 exit layer 被 action head 'consume'，functional information 被转化为 action prediction 而非保留在 hidden state 中。这不是 VLA-specific routing， 而是任何 decoder-only model 做 seq2seq mapping 时的 normal information bottleneck。你需要对比 LLM 在 NLP task fine-tuning 下的 exit layer R² 来排除这个 confound——但你没做这个 control。\\\" Reviewer B 补充：\\\"untrained model（random init）的 last_preaction R² 在 L10-L13 pathological (≈0) 不是 exit collapse 的对照——random init model 在深层的 R²≈0 只是说明随机权重不能解码信息，这与 trained model 的 exit collapse 机制完全不同。你实际上没有一个 clean baseline。\\\"\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"CLIP-ViT pretraining control\",\n    \"description\": \"CLIP ViT-L 替代 SigLIP 区分 VL pretraining vs encoder quality\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"clip_rsa\": 0.557,\n      \"clip_R2\": 0.587,\n      \"clip_lt_dino_in_both\": true,\n      \"vl_pretraining_not_sufficient\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Encoder Comparison: DINO Dominance Problem\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Encoder\",\n          \"RSA\",\n          \"R²\",\n          \"Has Language?\",\n          \"Worst Implication\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"DINO cls\",\n            \"0.692\",\n            \"0.634\",\n            \"No\",\n            \"Best in both metrics without language\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SigLIP+Proj\",\n            \"0.615\",\n            \"0.630\",\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"VL pretraining inferior to DINO\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CLIP ViT-L\",\n            \"0.557\",\n            \"0.587\",\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"VL pretraining worst of three\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Implication\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"Language supervision hurts encoder quality?\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"CLIP 结果在 worst tier 下不仅否定 VL pretraining 的 encoder quality claim， 更挑战论文研究 instruction routing 的 motivation：如果最好的 action representations 来自无 language 的 encoder，instruction routing research 的 practical relevance 是什么？Framework reframe 可以 acknowledge 这个 tension 并 argue \\\"understanding routing is important precisely because the relationship between language and action is non-obvious\\\"。\\n\\n\\n数据已完成：CLIP RSA=0.557 < DINO cls=0.692，R²=0.587 < DINO R²=0.634。 VL pretraining 不优于 self-supervised。Worst D095 下，此结果被 reviewer 进一步延伸：\\\"你们的 CLIP < DINO 结果说明 vision encoder 质量不取决于 language supervision，那你们为什么还在论文里花大量篇幅讨论 instruction routing？如果最好的 action representation 来自无 language 的 DINO， 那 VLA 的 instruction routing 可能是 overhead 而非 feature。\\\" 这挑战了整篇论文的前提——studying instruction routing in VLA 的意义。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Branch-split RSA\",\n    \"description\": \"DinoSigLIP fused backbone 中 DINOv2 vs SigLIP branch 分离\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"dinov2_branch_rsa\": 0.619,\n      \"siglip_branch_rsa\": 0.621,\n      \"fused_rsa\": 0.634,\n      \"post_projector_rsa\": 0.615\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Framework reframe 下可保留为 appendix 的 \\\"framework depth demo\\\"—— 展示 framework 能做 sub-encoder-level 分析。但不占 main text 篇幅。\\n\\n\\n数据不变。DINOv2 ≈ SigLIP（Δ<0.002）在 fused backbone 内。 Worst D095 下，此实验仅适用于 OpenVLA 的 DinoSigLIP backbone。 TracVLA 用 Phi-3-Vision 的不同 vision encoder（SigLIP-based 但 架构不同），NORA 用 InternViT。Branch-split analysis 不可迁移到 其他架构。Reviewer：\\\"这是一个 OpenVLA architecture-specific 的 interesting detail，但对 cross-architecture story 无贡献。\\\" 在 8 页限制下，worst tier 建议移到 appendix。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cross-Architecture R² Exit Collapse Matrix\",\n    \"description\": \"3 架构 × 4 suite 的 R² exit collapse 矩阵——D095 升级的核心证据\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_matrix_cells\": 10,\n      \"cells_with_clear_collapse\": 6,\n      \"cells_with_weak_or_absent_collapse\": 4,\n      \"openvla_goal_trained_delta\": 0.069,\n      \"openvla_spatial_trained_delta\": 0.04,\n      \"openvla_object_trained_delta\": 0.121,\n      \"openvla_long_trained_delta\": 0.004,\n      \"tracvla_goal_trained_delta\": 0.09,\n      \"tracvla_spatial_trained_delta\": 0.138,\n      \"tracvla_object_trained_delta\": 0.294,\n      \"tracvla_long_trained_delta\": 0.198,\n      \"nora_goal_trained_delta\": 0.691,\n      \"nora_spatial_trained_delta\": 0.302,\n      \"mean_trained_exit_delta\": 0.096,\n      \"cross_arch_r2_peak_layer_std\": 6.2,\n      \"r2_collapse_confirmed_cells\": 6\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"R² Exit Collapse Matrix (Worst-Tier Interpretation)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Architecture\",\n          \"Suite\",\n          \"Trained Delta\",\n          \"Untrained Delta\",\n          \"Ratio\",\n          \"Verdict\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"OpenVLA\",\n            \"Goal\",\n            \"0.069\",\n            \"0.015\",\n            \"4.6x\",\n            \"Moderate\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OpenVLA\",\n            \"Spatial\",\n            \"0.040\",\n            \"0.023\",\n            \"1.7x\",\n            \"Weak — near noise\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OpenVLA\",\n            \"Object\",\n            \"0.121\",\n            \"0.076\",\n            \"1.6x\",\n            \"Moderate but untrained also high\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OpenVLA\",\n            \"Long (OFT)\",\n            \"0.004\",\n            \"0.016\",\n            \"0.25x\",\n            \"FAIL — no collapse\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TracVLA\",\n            \"Goal\",\n            \"0.090\",\n            \"0.048\",\n            \"1.9x\",\n            \"Weak\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TracVLA\",\n            \"Spatial\",\n            \"0.138\",\n            \"0.016\",\n            \"8.6x\",\n            \"Strong\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TracVLA\",\n            \"Object\",\n            \"0.294\",\n            \"0.009\",\n            \"32.7x\",\n            \"Strong\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TracVLA\",\n            \"Long\",\n            \"0.198\",\n            \"0.028\",\n            \"7.1x\",\n            \"Strong\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"NORA\",\n            \"Goal\",\n            \"0.691\",\n            \"0.044\",\n            \"15.7x\",\n            \"Extreme — outlier?\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"NORA\",\n            \"Spatial\",\n            \"0.302\",\n            \"0.037\",\n            \"8.2x\",\n            \"Strong\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Matrix Coverage and Gaps\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"Value\",\n          \"Worst Interpretation\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Cells filled\",\n            \"10/12\",\n            \"NORA Object/Long missing — incomplete\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Clear collapse (>0.10)\",\n            \"6/10\",\n            \"Only 60% cells show clear effect\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Weak/absent\",\n            \"4/10\",\n            \"40% cells ambiguous or failed\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Delta range\",\n            \"0.004–0.691\",\n            \"172x range — not 'consistent'\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Peak layer std\",\n            \"6.2\",\n            \"High variability in where collapse occurs\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Worst tier 核心判定：cross-architecture R² exit collapse 是方向一致的（9/10 trained>untrained） 但 magnitude 高度不一致（0.004-0.691）。\\\"Architecture-independent signature\\\" claim 在 worst tier 下被降级为 \\\"a directionally consistent but magnitude-variable observation\\\"。 Reviewer 要求：(1) 解释 magnitude variation 的 mechanism（为什么 NORA 15x 于 OpenVLA？）， (2) 排除 training procedure confound（自训练 vs 社区 checkpoint）， (3) 提供 NLP fine-tuning baseline 排除 decoder-only generic effect。 Framework reframe：exit collapse 降为 \\\"one of the patterns detected by our framework\\\" 而非 \\\"the architecture-independent signature\\\"。强调 framework 能 systematically reveal cross-architecture variation 而非 uniformity。\\n\\n\\nWorst tier 假设：(1) OpenVLA Spatial（RUNNING）结果弱——exit delta 仅 0.04， 远低于其他 cells，且 untrained 也有 0.023 delta，training effect 仅 1.7x。 (2) OpenVLA Long (OFT) delta=0.004 已是 outlier。(3) NORA Object/Long 缺失（无 checkpoint），矩阵只有 10/12 cells。(4) 6/10 cells 有 clear collapse（delta>0.10 且 trained>>untrained），但 4 cells 弱或例外。\\nReviewer 攻击：\\\"你们声称 'architecture-independent' 但 10 个 cell 中 4 个 不支持。OpenVLA 的 2/4 suites 要么 delta≈0 (Long) 要么 delta 很小 (Spatial)。 只有 TracVLA 和 NORA 显示强 collapse——但这两个是你们自己训练的 checkpoint 而非社区标准模型。OpenVLA 是唯一的社区 checkpoint，它的结果最弱。 这可能说明 strong exit collapse 是你们训练流程的 artifact 而非 VLA training 的 inherent property。\\\"\\nReviewer B 补充：\\\"NORA goal delta=0.691 和 spatial delta=0.302 是极端值—— 比其他架构高一个数量级。这种 high variance across architectures（std=6.2 in peak layer）说明 exit collapse 的 magnitude 高度 architecture-dependent， 而你们只是 cherry-pick 了所有 delta>0 的 cell 来 claim 'consistent'。 Consistent direction（都 >0）但 inconsistent magnitude（0.004 到 0.691） ——这不叫 architecture-independent signature，这叫 noisy observation。\\\"\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cross-Architecture L1 Attention (D090 Training-Induced vs Base-Model)\",\n    \"description\": \"3 架构的 L1 instruction-dominant heads 对比——D090 区分 training vs base-model effects\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"openvla_trained_l1_heads\": 24,\n      \"openvla_untrained_l1_heads\": 0,\n      \"openvla_oxe_l1_heads\": 25,\n      \"tracvla_trained_l1_heads\": [\n        27,\n        30\n      ],\n      \"tracvla_untrained_l1_heads\": 32,\n      \"nora_trained_l1_heads\": [\n        12,\n        13\n      ],\n      \"nora_untrained_l1_heads\": [\n        13,\n        14\n      ],\n      \"training_induced\": false,\n      \"base_model_dependent\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"L1 Heads: Base-Model Dominance (D090)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Architecture\",\n          \"Backbone\",\n          \"Trained\",\n          \"Untrained\",\n          \"Training Effect\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"OpenVLA\",\n            \"Llama-2-7B\",\n            \"24/32\",\n            \"0/32 (random)\",\n            \"Artifact: random init has no LM ability\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OpenVLA\",\n            \"OXE-pretrained\",\n            \"24/32\",\n            \"25/32 (OXE)\",\n            \"Zero: OXE already saturated\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TracVLA\",\n            \"Phi-3-mini\",\n            \"27-30/32\",\n            \"32/32 (VLM)\",\n            \"Negative: training reduces heads\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"NORA\",\n            \"Qwen2.5-VL-3B\",\n            \"12-13/16\",\n            \"13-14/16\",\n            \"Zero: same before and after\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Remaining Training-Induced Effects After D090\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Effect\",\n          \"Evidence Strength\",\n          \"VLA-Specificity\",\n          \"Contribution Weight\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"R² exit collapse\",\n            \"6/10 cells\",\n            \"Questionable (need NLP control)\",\n            \"Thin\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CF sensitivity\",\n            \"11/12 settings\",\n            \"Moderate (empty ≠ original)\",\n            \"Thin\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L1 head count\",\n            \"REMOVED by D090\",\n            \"Base-model artifact\",\n            \"Zero\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Total remaining\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"Near-minimal for CoRL\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"D090 在 worst tier 下是论文最大的 self-inflicted wound。Framework reframe 的关键 pivot：把 D090 从 \\\"limitation that weakens the paper\\\" 转为 \\\"framework's key analytical capability\\\"——\\\"our framework can distinguish training-induced from pre-existing properties, which is crucial for understanding what VLA training actually does.\\\" 这种 reframe 让 D090 变成 framework 的 selling point 而非 paper 的 weakness。但 reviewer 可能看穿这个 rhetorical move。\\n\\n\\nD090 发现 L1 head count 是 base-model-dependent 而非 training-induced。 Worst tier 解读：这是论文最严重的自我削弱。Reviewer：\\\"你们自己证明了 L1 routing——论文最 visually striking 的结果（0→9→24 heads gradient）—— 不是训练学到的。TracVLA untrained 已经 32/32 全极化，NORA untrained 已经 13/16。那 VLA training 到底贡献了什么？剩下的 training-induced effects 只有 R² exit collapse 和 CF sensitivity。但 exit collapse 可能是 generic fine-tuning effect（见上），CF sensitivity 可能只是 'model produces different outputs for different inputs' 的 trivial restatement。 你们把自己的 contribution 证伪到只剩一个 questionable finding。\\\"\\nD090 被解读为 \\\"VLA training 的独特效果只剩 exit collapse 一个，contribution 太薄\\\"。 即使 exit collapse confirmed in 6/10 cells，作为唯一 training-induced effect 支撑一篇 CoRL paper 太单薄。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cross-Architecture Counterfactual Sensitivity\",\n    \"description\": \"3 架构的 counterfactual instruction sensitivity 对比\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"openvla_object_d\": 1.21,\n      \"tracvla_goal_d\": 1.52,\n      \"tracvla_spatial_d\": 1.33,\n      \"tracvla_object_d\": 1.21,\n      \"tracvla_long_d\": 1.47,\n      \"nora_goal_cos_saturated\": 1.0,\n      \"cf_sensitivity_ratio_range\": [\n        2,\n        8\n      ],\n      \"empty_always_top\": \"11/12 settings\",\n      \"openvla_long_anomaly\": \"shuffled > empty\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"CF Sensitivity: Trained vs Untrained (Worst Interpretation)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Architecture\",\n          \"Suite\",\n          \"Trained d\",\n          \"Untrained (cos)\",\n          \"Ratio\",\n          \"Reviewer Critique\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"OpenVLA\",\n            \"Object\",\n            \"1.21\",\n            \"0.569\",\n            \"2.1x\",\n            \"Moderate, within generic fine-tuning range\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TracVLA\",\n            \"Goal\",\n            \"1.52\",\n            \"0.153\",\n            \"9.9x\",\n            \"Strong but unfair: untrained=VLM base\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TracVLA\",\n            \"Spatial\",\n            \"1.33\",\n            \"0.180\",\n            \"7.4x\",\n            \"Same unfair comparison\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TracVLA\",\n            \"Object\",\n            \"1.21\",\n            \"0.185\",\n            \"6.5x\",\n            \"Same unfair comparison\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TracVLA\",\n            \"Long\",\n            \"1.47\",\n            \"0.173\",\n            \"8.5x\",\n            \"Same unfair comparison\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"NORA\",\n            \"Goal\",\n            \"saturated (1.0)\",\n            \"0.081\",\n            \"12.3x\",\n            \"Numerical artifact? exit layer orthogonal\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"CF sensitivity 在 worst tier 下保持 directionally valid 但 fair comparison 被质疑。关键缺失控制：NLP-finetuned LLM 的 CF sensitivity。 Framework reframe：CF analysis 降为 \\\"framework capability demonstration\\\"， future work 建议跨 domain（NLP/vision/robotics）对比 CF sensitivity。\\n\\n\\nCF sensitivity 是仅存的两个 training-induced effects 之一（D090 后）。 Worst tier 攻击：Reviewer：\\\"counterfactual sensitivity 只是说 'trained model produces different outputs for different instructions'——这是 ANY trained language model 的 basic capability，不是 VLA-specific routing。你们的 untrained model 是 random init（OpenVLA）或 base VLM without action head（TracVLA/NORA）， 当然 CF sensitivity 低——它们根本不是 functional models。这不是 fair comparison。 一个 fair comparison 是 Llama-2 fine-tuned on NLP 的 counterfactual sensitivity—— 如果它也显示类似 pattern，那 CF sensitivity 是 instruction following 的 generic property 而非 VLA routing。\\\"\\nNORA 的 cosine distance = 1.0（saturated）也有问题——这可能是 numerical artifact 而非 genuine effect（Qwen2.5-VL 的 exit layer 表征可能在不同 instruction 下 彻底 orthogonal 由于某种 architectural reason，而非 VLA training effect）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Three-Tier Routing Gradient (D094)\",\n    \"description\": \"VLM base → OXE-pretrained VLA → task-finetuned VLA 三层级路由梯度\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"tier1_l1_heads\": [\n        0,\n        32\n      ],\n      \"tier1_cf_sensitivity\": \"<0.2\",\n      \"tier1_exit_collapse\": false,\n      \"tier2_l1_heads\": 25,\n      \"tier2_cf_d\": 1.048,\n      \"tier2_exit_collapse\": false,\n      \"tier3_exit_collapse\": true,\n      \"tier3_cf_d\": [\n        1.2,\n        1.5\n      ],\n      \"gradient_narrative\": \"routing emerges at VLM→VLA, reshapes at general→specific\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Three-Tier Gradient: Data Sparsity (Worst-Tier)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Tier\",\n          \"Description\",\n          \"N data points\",\n          \"Evidence\",\n          \"Reviewer Critique\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Tier 1: VLM base\",\n            \"No action training\",\n            \"3 (Phi-3, Qwen2.5, random)\",\n            \"No collapse, low CF\",\n            \"Adequate N\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Tier 2: OXE-pretrained\",\n            \"General action training\",\n            \"1 (openvla-7b ONLY)\",\n            \"No collapse, strong CF, strong L1\",\n            \"N=1, cannot establish gradient\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Tier 3: Task-finetuned\",\n            \"Task-specific training\",\n            \"~10 (3 arch × 4 suites)\",\n            \"Collapse + task CF\",\n            \"Adequate N\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Verdict\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"Step function, not gradient\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Worst tier 下三层级梯度必须移除或降为 \\\"preliminary observation\\\"。 Framework reframe：不 claim gradient，改为 \\\"framework enables comparison across training stages\\\"——展示 framework 能分析不同训练阶段， 但不 claim 发现了 systematic gradient。Future work 建议收集更多 Tier-2 数据点（不同的 OXE-pretrained checkpoints、不同的 pretraining datasets）来测试 gradient hypothesis。\\n\\n\\n三层级梯度被驳为 post-hoc narrative。Worst tier 核心问题：Tier-2 只有一个 数据点（OpenVLA OXE-pretrained）。Reviewer：\\\"你们的 three-tier gradient 有 multiple Tier-1 数据点（TracVLA Phi-3-Vision, NORA Qwen2.5-VL）和 multiple Tier-3 数据点（3 arch × 4 suites），但 Tier-2 只有 ONE 数据点 （openvla-7b OXE pretrained）。Three-tier gradient 需要 at least 3 intermediate points 才能建立 gradient 而非 step function。你实际上只有 step function：VLM (no routing) → VLA (routing)。'Gradient' 这个词 暗示 continuous variation，但你只有 binary transition + 1 intermediate。\\\"\\n更致命的是 Tier-2 的 L1 heads（25/32）几乎与 Tier-3（24/32）相同—— D090 已经证明 L1 heads 是 base-model-dependent。所以 Tier-2→Tier-3 transition 的 routing 变化主要体现在 exit collapse（有/无）和 CF pattern（general/task-specific）——但这些效应量很小且可能是 generic fine-tuning effect。\\n三层级叙事的第三个问题：没有第四层（如 multi-task→single-task fine-tuning） 来验证 gradient 是 monotonic 的。如果 further specialization 反而 reduces routing（如 libero_finetuned 数据中 L31 exit engagement 18→0）， 那 gradient narrative 不成立——routing 不是 monotonically increasing with specialization。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"OpenVLA Goal Standardized Pipeline (RUNNING)\",\n    \"description\": \"OpenVLA LIBERO-Goal 标准化全流程——统一方法和指标的 re-run\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"r2_exit_collapse_delta\": 0.07,\n      \"l1_instruction_dominant\": 24,\n      \"cf_empty_d\": 0.98,\n      \"cf_sensitivity_ratio\": 3.5,\n      \"cross_instruction_accuracy\": 1.0,\n      \"rsa_peak_layer\": 12\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Standardized vs Original: Consistency Check\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"Original\",\n          \"Standardized\",\n          \"Delta\",\n          \"Concern\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"R² exit delta\",\n            \"0.069\",\n            \"0.070\",\n            \"+0.001\",\n            \"Consistent but trivial\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L1 instr-dom heads\",\n            \"24/32\",\n            \"24/32\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"Identical\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CF empty d\",\n            \"0.968\",\n            \"0.980\",\n            \"+0.012\",\n            \"Consistent\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"RSA peak\",\n            \"L12\",\n            \"L12\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"Identical\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Standardized pipeline 在 worst tier 下的隐含风险：承认之前的实验 不够 standardized，可能让 reviewer 质疑所有之前的数字。 但如果数字高度一致，也可以作为 robustness evidence。 Framework reframe：强调 standardized pipeline 是 framework 的 核心贡献之一——\\\"plug-and-play analysis toolkit\\\"。\\n\\n\\nRUNNING 实验。Worst tier 预测：结果与已有 OpenVLA Goal 数据基本一致 （exit delta≈0.07, L1 heads≈24），因为使用相同 checkpoint。 但 standardized pipeline 可能暴露之前分散实验的 inconsistency—— 例如不同实验使用了略微不同的 hyperparameters（probe architecture, learning rate, seed）导致数字不完全 match。Reviewer 会注意到 \\\"为什么你需要 re-run standardized pipeline？之前的数字不可靠吗？\\\" 这暗示之前的 ad-hoc 实验流程不够 rigorous。 在 worst tier 下，standardized re-run 得到 slightly different numbers (e.g., exit delta 0.07 vs 之前的 0.069) 会被解读为 \\\"results are hyperparameter-sensitive\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"OpenVLA Spatial Standardized Pipeline (RUNNING)\",\n    \"description\": \"OpenVLA LIBERO-Spatial 标准化全流程\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"r2_exit_collapse_delta\": 0.04,\n      \"l1_instruction_dominant\": 24,\n      \"cf_empty_d\": 0.94,\n      \"cf_sensitivity_ratio\": 3.0,\n      \"exit_collapse_weak\": true,\n      \"matrix_cell_verdict\": \"weak — borderline\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"OpenVLA Cross-Suite Exit Collapse (Worst-Tier)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Suite\",\n          \"Trained Delta\",\n          \"Verdict\",\n          \"Paper Implication\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Goal\",\n            \"0.070\",\n            \"Moderate\",\n            \"Supports claim with caveats\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Spatial\",\n            \"0.040\",\n            \"Weak\",\n            \"Borderline — weakens universality\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Object\",\n            \"0.121\",\n            \"Moderate-Strong\",\n            \"Best OpenVLA cell\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Long (OFT)\",\n            \"0.004\",\n            \"Absent\",\n            \"Outlier — OFT confound\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Overall\",\n            \"mean=0.059\",\n            \"Weak-Moderate\",\n            \"OpenVLA is the WEAKEST architecture\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"OpenVLA Spatial 弱结果是 worst tier 最关键的预测。如果确认， 论文面临 \\\"社区 checkpoint 最弱\\\" 的尴尬叙事——reviewer 会问 \\\"如果你们用社区标准 checkpoint 复现你们的发现，效果最弱， 这是否说明 strong exit collapse 是你们自训练流程的 artifact？\\\" Framework reframe 可以 acknowledge OpenVLA 作为 \\\"weaker case\\\" 并 argue \\\"our framework's value is precisely in revealing such cross-architecture variation\\\"。\\n\\n\\nRUNNING 实验，worst tier 核心关注。预测 exit delta 仅 0.04—— 显著弱于 OpenVLA Object (0.121) 和其他架构。原因： (1) LIBERO-Spatial 的 action 空间以位置 reasoning 为主， exit layer 需要保留更多 spatial information 来输出精确 actions， 所以 collapse 较弱。(2) OpenVLA 在 Spatial task 上的 fine-tuning quality 可能较低（Spatial 是最难的 LIBERO suite）， 训练不充分导致 exit reorganization 不完全。(3) 如果 untrained 也有 delta≈0.023，则 training effect ratio 仅 1.7x—— 在统计上可能 borderline significant。\\n这个结果直接影响 matrix 的 story：OpenVLA 的 4 个 suite 中 2 个（Spatial 0.04, Long 0.004）weak/absent，只有 Object (0.121) 和 Goal (0.07) moderate。社区标准 checkpoint 的 2/4 suites 不支持 exit collapse = 严重的 generalizability concern。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"D090 Training-Induced vs Base-Model Distinction Synthesis\",\n    \"description\": \"综合分析：VLA training 实际贡献了什么——D090 后的 contribution auditing\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"training_induced_effects\": [\n        \"R² exit collapse (6/10 cells)\",\n        \"CF sensitivity (11/12 settings)\"\n      ],\n      \"base_model_effects\": [\n        \"L1 head count\",\n        \"deep-layer probe stability\"\n      ],\n      \"removed_from_contribution\": [\n        \"L1 routing gradient (0→9→24)\",\n        \"attention reorganization\"\n      ],\n      \"remaining_unique_contribution\": \"thin — 1-2 effects, both questionable VLA-specificity\",\n      \"reviewer_expected_reaction\": \"contribution too thin for CoRL\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Contribution Audit After D090 (Worst-Tier)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Claimed Contribution\",\n          \"Status Post-D090\",\n          \"VLA-Specific?\",\n          \"Reviewer Verdict\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"L1 routing (0→9→24)\",\n            \"REMOVED — base-model artifact\",\n            \"No\",\n            \"Cannot claim\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"R² exit collapse\",\n            \"Retained but 4/10 cells weak\",\n            \"Questionable\",\n            \"Need NLP control\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CF sensitivity\",\n            \"Retained, 11/12 settings\",\n            \"Questionable\",\n            \"Unfair baseline\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Three-tier gradient\",\n            \"N=1 at Tier-2\",\n            \"Thin\",\n            \"Post-hoc narrative\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Experimental framework\",\n            \"Intact\",\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"Main contribution in reframe\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Metric dissociation (RSA/CKA/R²)\",\n            \"Intact\",\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"Methodological\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Worst-Tier Reviewer Score Prediction\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Reviewer\",\n          \"Score\",\n          \"Main Concern\",\n          \"Accept/Reject\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"R1 (generalizability)\",\n            \"3\",\n            \"40% matrix cells weak; no NLP control; contribution too thin\",\n            \"Reject\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"R2 (methodology)\",\n            \"5\",\n            \"Framework is solid and reusable; findings secondary but valid\",\n            \"Weak Accept\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"R3 (practical value)\",\n            \"3\",\n            \"No behavioral validation; no design implications tested; CoRL wants practical\",\n            \"Reject\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mean\",\n            \"3.67\",\n            \"2 reject, 1 weak accept\",\n            \"Likely Reject\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Worst tier 核心结论：D090 的 honest analysis 是 scientifically correct 但 strategically devastating。论文自己证明了 3 个原 claim pillars 中 1 个是 base-model artifact（L1 routing），另外 2 个（exit collapse, CF） 缺少 critical controls。剩余的 unique contribution 太薄支撑 CoRL paper。\\nReframe 路径（accept probability 0.10→0.20 的条件）： (1) C1 升级为主贡献——framework 本身（factorial design + 4 methods + 3 arch validation） 是可复用工具，CoRL 有 benchmark/framework paper 先例。 (2) R² collapse 和 CF sensitivity 降为 \\\"findings the framework reveals\\\"—— 不 claim VLA-specific，改为 \\\"training-induced effects observable through our framework\\\"。 (3) D090 repackage 为 \\\"framework's distinguishing capability\\\"—— 能区分 training-induced vs pre-existing 是 framework 的 unique selling point。 (4) 增加 2-3 个 additional analyses（per-layer information flow entropy, cross-task representation transfer analysis）增强 framework demonstration value。 (5) 三层级梯度移除或降为 1 段 future work。 (6) 明确 roadmap：\\\"framework enables future closed-loop behavioral studies\\\"。 (7) Title 从 \\\"Architecture-Independent Routing in VLAs\\\" 改为 \\\"A Systematic Framework for Analyzing Instruction Processing in VLAs\\\"。\\n即使全部执行，worst tier accept probability 仍只 0.05-0.20—— 因为 CoRL 倾向 \\\"systems + results\\\" 而非 \\\"analysis + framework\\\"。\\n\\nD090 移除了最 visually striking 的结果（L1 head gradient）后， 论文的 unique contribution audit 在 worst tier 下： (1) R² exit collapse — 6/10 cells 确认但 magnitude 高度可变， 可能是 generic fine-tuning effect（缺 NLP control）。 (2) CF sensitivity — 11/12 settings trained > untrained， 但 unfair baseline（untrained = random init 或 VLM without action head）。 (3) 三层级梯度 — N=1 at Tier-2，post-hoc narrative。\\n至少 2 个 reviewer 给 reject，原因集中在： - \\\"What does VLA training ACTUALLY do that's unique? After your own D090\\n  analysis, the answer is 'exit collapse' — which may not be VLA-specific.\\\"\\n- \\\"Practical value unclear: knowing about exit collapse doesn't help\\n  build better VLAs. No behavioral validation, no design implications tested.\\\"\\n- \\\"The paper's main strength is the experimental framework, not the findings.\\n  But CoRL reviews papers for findings, not frameworks.\\\"\\n\\nExpected reviewer avg score: 3.5 (range 3.0-4.5) Accept probability: 0.10 (range 0.05-0.20)\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":1107,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1107}}}
